01:33.620 --> 01:37.180
<b>- The sea! The sea!
- The mountains, the mountains!</b>

01:37.640 --> 01:39.600
<b>If we're going camping, the mountains are the best!</b>

01:39.850 --> 01:42.140
<b>It's cuz you can't swim, right, Nobita?</b>

01:42.270 --> 01:44.770
<b>Huh?! A-Absolutely not!</b>

01:45.650 --> 01:47.480
<b>What about you, Shizuka-chan?</b>

01:47.820 --> 01:50.360
<b>Being surrounded by greenery and fresh air...</b>

01:50.490 --> 01:52.280
<b>Waking up to the chirping of birds...</b>

01:52.400 --> 01:53.910
<b>The mountains are the best, aren't they?!</b>

01:54.030 --> 01:58.200
<b>Marine activities, colorful corals, and fish!</b>

01:58.330 --> 02:00.410
<b>No matter how you look at it, the sea is the best!</b>

02:00.540 --> 02:02.370
<b>I guess so...</b>

02:02.500 --> 02:04.750
<b>It is nice to go to the mountains once in a while...</b>

02:04.880 --> 02:06.170
<b>Yay!</b>

02:06.290 --> 02:09.380
<b>- It's two against two, huh?
- Heheh.</b>

02:09.500 --> 02:11.760
<b>There's someone else too, right?</b>

02:11.880 --> 02:13.840
<b>So, he'll be the one to decide!</b>

02:13.970 --> 02:16.300
<b>- Ah!
- That's right!</b>

02:16.430 --> 02:19.680
<b>In that case...
Haste makes waste!</b>

02:19.810 --> 02:22.640
<b>- It's "Strike while the iron's hot"!
- W-Wait!</b>

