04:07.870 --> 04:09.540
<b>Hotttt...</b>

04:10.830 --> 04:12.880
<b>- The sea!
- The mountains!</b>

04:13.750 --> 04:15.760
<b>Doraemon, the mountains, right?!</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:17.260
<b>Definitely the sea!</b>

04:17.380 --> 04:18.630
<b>The mountains are great too!</b>

04:18.760 --> 04:20.260
<b>The sea, right?!</b>

04:20.510 --> 04:22.350
<b>Which one, Doraemon?!</b>

04:23.180 --> 04:24.770
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

04:24.890 --> 04:27.560
<b>We're all thinking of going camping.</b>

04:27.680 --> 04:29.900
<b>But we're split on where we wanna go.</b>

04:30.020 --> 04:31.860
<b>Yer goin' too, right?</b>

04:31.980 --> 04:34.070
<b>You have the deciding vote, Dora-chan!</b>

04:34.190 --> 04:35.610
<b>It's definitely the mountains!</b>

04:35.730 --> 04:36.690
<b>The sea, right?!</b>

04:36.820 --> 04:38.780
<b>Summer means going to the beach, right?!</b>

04:38.900 --> 04:39.740
<b>Mountains!</b>

04:39.860 --> 04:42.370
<b>Hey, hey, Doraemon...</b>

04:42.490 --> 04:45.950
<b>The light filtering in through the gaps in the trees...
Definitely the mountains!</b>

04:46.080 --> 04:48.000
<b>We can smash watermelons on the beach...</b>

04:48.120 --> 04:50.000
<b>Snorkeling... and other stuff like that.</b>

04:50.120 --> 04:52.420
<b>In the mountains, we can have a
barbecue and go hiking, right?</b>

04:52.540 --> 04:54.290
<b>- Hey, Doraemon...
- Doraemon!</b>

04:54.420 --> 04:57.050
<b>- Dora-chan.
- Doraemooon!</b>

04:57.170 --> 05:01.590
<b>SHUT UP!</b>

05:10.640 --> 05:13.150
<b>Why's he so angry?</b>

05:13.270 --> 05:14.860
<b>What a mood-killer.</b>

05:16.070 --> 05:18.650
<b>Hey, what about the camping trip?</b>

05:18.860 --> 05:21.650
<b>So long as Doraemon's like that...</b>

05:22.360 --> 05:24.870
<b>Hey, let's cool off at yer place.</b>

05:24.990 --> 05:26.030
<b>Eh... You're coming?</b>

05:26.660 --> 05:29.410
<b>Everyone's irritable due to the heat.</b>

05:29.660 --> 05:32.120
<b>Let's talk about it some other time.
See you.</b>

05:37.500 --> 05:40.840
<b>Hah... it's supposed to be summer vacation too.</b>

05:41.090 --> 05:42.970
<b>Everyone's split up...</b>

05:49.470 --> 05:52.520
<b><i>The shipwreck occurred approximately 450 years ago.</i></b>

05:52.640 --> 05:54.350
<b><i>Loaded up with Incan treasures,</i></b>

05:54.480 --> 05:57.150
<b><i>it's believed this ship was lost at sea en route to Spain.</i></b>

05:57.400 --> 06:00.490
<b><i>In Japanese yen, it is approximately 20 trillion yen.</i></b>

06:00.610 --> 06:02.200
<b><i>Gold and ornaments were onboard...</i></b>

06:02.320 --> 06:04.740
<b>20 trillion yen?!</b>

06:04.870 --> 06:07.370
<b><i>Careful consideration is underway
on whether to raise the wreck...</i></b>

06:27.980 --> 06:31.560
<b>I know a place where we can enjoy
both the sea and the mountains!</b>

06:33.810 --> 06:35.650
<b>A place like that exists?</b>

06:45.950 --> 06:48.570
<b>But... isn't this an ordinary sea?</b>

06:52.410 --> 06:54.160
<b>Where're the mountains?</b>

06:55.500 --> 06:57.210
<b>It's right here.</b>

06:58.250 --> 07:00.670
<b>At the bottom of the sea,
the sea floor!</b>

07:00.800 --> 07:02.710
<b>Mountains on the sea floor?</b>

07:08.930 --> 07:11.680
<b>What's this? Hahah, it's cool!</b>

07:13.480 --> 07:15.310
<b>It's an Underwater Buggy.</b>

07:16.650 --> 07:20.230
<b>Now, let's explore the
underwater mountains and plains!</b>

07:22.110 --> 07:23.940
<b>Now, get on.</b>

07:27.780 --> 07:31.950
<b>- Oh right. Use this first.
- What're those?</b>

07:32.080 --> 07:33.500
<b>Gill Tubes.</b>

07:33.620 --> 07:37.420
<b>If you put these in your nose,
you can breathe underwater.</b>

07:37.540 --> 07:39.750
<b>Huh?! We're going to dive?!</b>

07:40.170 --> 07:42.340
<b>Now, it's fine, it's fine.</b>

07:42.460 --> 07:44.630
<b>Now, let's go!</b>

07:46.880 --> 07:48.930
<b>Forward!</b>

08:13.410 --> 08:14.910
<b>Greetings.</b>

08:15.040 --> 08:16.040
<b>What?</b>

08:16.080 --> 08:19.040
<b>I booted up the Underwater Buggy's computer.</b>

08:19.170 --> 08:21.380
<b>Autopilot and Guide please.</b>

08:21.500 --> 08:24.880
<b>Understood.
I will scan the surrounding area.</b>

08:27.920 --> 08:31.680
<b>The Pacific Ocean, off the coast of Japan.
This is the continental shelf.</b>

08:31.800 --> 08:32.930
<b>Continental shelf?</b>

08:33.050 --> 08:35.850
<b>Are you unfamiliar with continental shelves?</b>

08:35.970 --> 08:39.190
<b>It refers to a flat area of land
extending from the coast.</b>

08:39.310 --> 08:41.350
<b>He's kinda annoying.</b>

08:41.480 --> 08:43.520
<b>Well, it's a cheap, used item...</b>

08:46.400 --> 08:48.240
<b>It's not flat at all!</b>

08:48.360 --> 08:49.700
<b>This is a continental slope.</b>

08:49.820 --> 08:52.490
<b>This continues for several kilometers,
all the way to the sea floor.</b>

08:53.780 --> 08:55.990
<b>This is some good learning
for you, Nobita-kun.</b>

09:00.870 --> 09:05.050
<b>It's kinda dark... and it's getting cold.</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:06.250
<b>Of course.</b>

09:08.170 --> 09:11.720
<b>We are almost at a distant of 200 meters
which means we are in the ocean depths.</b>

09:12.340 --> 09:15.640
<b>Because hardly any sunlight reaches here.</b>

09:15.760 --> 09:17.520
<b>The water temperature remains low.</b>

09:17.640 --> 09:19.640
<b>Then, it's about time...</b>

09:19.780 --> 09:23.450
Adapting Light

09:38.160 --> 09:39.410
<b>Pretty!</b>

09:39.540 --> 09:42.420
<b>Your body has adapted to the ocean depths.</b>

09:42.960 --> 09:46.210
<b>For real! It's not cold and I can see really well.</b>

09:46.340 --> 09:48.760
<b>In the 22nd century, we'll be visiting planets</b>

09:48.880 --> 09:51.880
<b>that humans simply cannot survive in.</b>

09:52.010 --> 09:55.350
<b>The Adapting Light lets you
adapt to any environment.</b>

09:55.470 --> 09:59.310
<b>Even if you dive 10,000 meters,
it's the same as if you're lying under the Sun.</b>

10:00.640 --> 10:02.890
<b>You don't even need the Gill Tubes anymore.</b>

10:03.020 --> 10:05.270
<b>Really? Hah...</b>

10:10.690 --> 10:12.900
<b>It's true! I can breathe!</b>

10:13.030 --> 10:15.950
<b>However, the effect lasts for only 24 hours.</b>

10:16.070 --> 10:17.950
<b>Humans have it hard, do they not?</b>

10:18.080 --> 10:20.870
<b>You need to rely on gadgets for every single thing.</b>

10:22.460 --> 10:24.960
<b>In that respect, I am fine even in the ocean depths.</b>

10:25.080 --> 10:27.880
<b>Due to my water pressure-resistant,
variable plastic body,</b>

10:28.000 --> 10:29.940
<b>my size and shape are completely customizable!</b>

10:33.300 --> 10:34.550
<b>Geez!</b>

10:34.680 --> 10:37.300
<b>But you don't need to shrink all of a sudden!</b>

10:37.430 --> 10:39.220
<b>I just wished to demonstrate my features.</b>

10:39.350 --> 10:41.310
<b>What else can you do?</b>

10:41.430 --> 10:43.180
<b>I am very fast.</b>

10:45.770 --> 10:47.110
<b>How is it?</b>

10:47.230 --> 10:48.820
<b>Amazing!</b>

10:49.320 --> 10:52.240
<b>Wait! Stop! Stop!</b>

10:52.360 --> 10:55.700
<b>- We're running out of ground!
- Don't worry.</b>

11:01.740 --> 11:03.620
<b>It can hover too?</b>

11:03.750 --> 11:07.330
<b>Attitude control thrusters.
A manufacturer option.</b>

11:07.460 --> 11:08.590
<b>What does that mean?</b>

11:08.710 --> 11:10.590
<b>That it has a lot of features.</b>

11:11.130 --> 11:14.550
<b>Eek! Are we really on Earth?</b>

11:15.300 --> 11:17.430
<b>This is the Japan Trench.</b>

11:23.060 --> 11:25.140
<b>Nobita-kun, look ahead.</b>

11:26.020 --> 11:30.480
<b>Wow! A mountain under the sea!</b>

11:31.770 --> 11:33.400
<b>See? I told you, didn't I?</b>

11:33.530 --> 11:36.490
<b>This way, we can enjoy both the
sea and the mountains, right?</b>

11:36.610 --> 11:37.610
<b>Hmm...</b>

11:37.860 --> 11:41.580
<b>It's rugged, and not quite 
like the mountains on land...</b>

11:42.080 --> 11:44.450
<b>I wonder if Shizuka-chan will like this?</b>

11:44.580 --> 11:47.790
<b>- Shizuka-chan?
- She's my friend.</b>

11:48.250 --> 11:51.250
<b>F-r-i-e-n-d?
What is that?</b>

11:52.050 --> 11:54.300
<b>Hmm... a friend is...</b>

11:54.420 --> 11:56.800
<b>Yeah! A person you're close to.</b>

11:56.930 --> 11:59.050
<b>What does 'being close' mean?</b>

11:59.180 --> 12:01.050
<b>Being close is...</b>

12:01.180 --> 12:02.560
<b>It's being close!</b>

12:02.680 --> 12:04.310
<b>That's not an answer.</b>

12:05.180 --> 12:07.190
<b>F-r-i-e-n-d...</b>

12:13.480 --> 12:16.240
<b>Buggy, around here should be good.</b>

12:21.030 --> 12:24.290
<b>Wow, what a great view!</b>

12:26.120 --> 12:29.120
<b>The location is perfect, so...</b>

12:29.250 --> 12:30.080
<b>For what?</b>

12:30.210 --> 12:33.380
<b>Delicious Clam!</b>

12:37.220 --> 12:38.800
<b>What kinda gadget is this?</b>

12:38.930 --> 12:40.340
<b>The Delicious Clam</b>

12:40.470 --> 12:44.470
<b>is a gadget for observing deep-sea creatures.</b>

12:46.520 --> 12:50.190
<b>Deep-sea creatures are attracted to light,</b>

12:51.690 --> 12:55.440
<b>so it releases specially formulated,
delicious, glowing plankton.</b>

12:55.570 --> 12:57.530
<b>They'll come one after another.</b>

13:04.950 --> 13:07.160
<b>We're not getting a lot of visitors, though?</b>

13:07.290 --> 13:09.210
<b>It's not that fast.</b>

13:09.330 --> 13:11.790
<b>Deep-sea creatures are energy-efficient.</b>

13:11.920 --> 13:13.960
<b>Many of them are slow to move.</b>

13:14.090 --> 13:15.840
<b>Are there any gadgets that can speed it up?</b>

13:15.960 --> 13:17.670
<b>Not really.</b>

13:17.800 --> 13:20.720
<b>Lots of them will be there when we camp though.</b>

13:20.840 --> 13:22.640
<b>Hmm... I see.</b>

13:22.760 --> 13:25.640
<b>All that's left is to get everyone here!</b>

13:27.850 --> 13:29.560
<b>A mountain on the sea floor?</b>

13:30.600 --> 13:34.230
<b>Yeah! It's an amazing view that
you'll never see on the surface!</b>

13:34.360 --> 13:36.270
<b>We can see deep-sea creatures...</b>

13:36.400 --> 13:37.860
<b>We can go hiking</b>

13:37.980 --> 13:40.610
<b>and drive around in the Underwater Buggy!</b>

13:40.900 --> 13:43.450
<b>Wow! That's lovely!</b>

13:45.870 --> 13:47.160
<b>The deep sea?!</b>

13:47.700 --> 13:49.910
<b>That's a yes from me!</b>

13:51.000 --> 13:52.670
<b>Well, that works.</b>

13:53.580 --> 13:56.210
<b>Let's raise that treasure ship we saw on the news!</b>

13:56.340 --> 13:57.420
<b>No way...</b>

13:57.550 --> 14:00.420
<b>The lifting operation has already begun.</b>

14:00.550 --> 14:03.010
<b>What, is it too late then?</b>

14:03.130 --> 14:06.470
<b>But camping on the sea floor
is a pretty rare experience.</b>

14:06.800 --> 14:09.970
<b>It's settled! Let's go to the deep sea!</b>

14:12.770 --> 14:14.480
<b>Yay!</b>

14:15.900 --> 14:17.770
<b>Huh?!</b>

14:18.070 --> 14:21.320
<b>You haven't done your summer
homework yet, have you?</b>

14:21.440 --> 14:25.490
<b>You're not going camping
until you've finished.</b>

14:27.620 --> 14:30.410
<b>Summer vacation will be
over by the time I finish!</b>

14:34.960 --> 14:37.880
<b>Mom's right, do your best.</b>

14:38.880 --> 14:42.340
<b>I understand!
I'll finish my homework quickly!</b>

14:45.930 --> 14:49.180
<b>We were all divided, but now
we've finally come to a decision!</b>

14:49.510 --> 14:51.640
<b>We're definitely going camping!</b>

14:51.770 --> 14:53.680
<b>That's the spirit!</b>

15:06.360 --> 15:07.490
<b>Nobita-kun?</b>

15:16.580 --> 15:18.790
<b>I'm worried about your future!</b>

15:56.160 --> 15:58.620
<b>Nobita-kun! Do your best!</b>

15:58.830 --> 16:01.000
<b>Nobita-kun! Do your best!</b>

16:01.130 --> 16:03.710
<b>Don't stop working!
Don't get distracted!</b>

16:03.840 --> 16:06.720
<b>Hang in there!
Don't give up on yourself!</b>

16:06.840 --> 16:09.800
<b>You can definitely do it!
It'll be alright!</b>

16:09.930 --> 16:12.640
<b>Go for it, Nobita! Go!</b>

16:12.760 --> 16:14.270
<b>Go for it... Hm?</b>

16:14.390 --> 16:18.140
<b>Enough!
My head's gonna explode!</b>

16:18.270 --> 16:22.020
<b>Ah... what are you doing?</b>

16:22.610 --> 16:23.610
<b>Geez...</b>

16:24.780 --> 16:26.030
<b>You've only finished two problems?!</b>

16:26.150 --> 16:27.820
<b>And they're wrong too...</b>

16:28.570 --> 16:31.160
<b>It's impossible for me anyways!</b>

16:31.280 --> 16:32.490
<b>It's okay, it's okay!</b>

16:32.620 --> 16:35.620
<b>I guess I'm not going
anywhere for summer vacation...</b>

16:40.500 --> 16:42.790
<b><i>Today will be another day of
scorching summer heat.</i></b>

16:42.920 --> 16:44.420
<b><i>Take care against heatstroke...</i></b>

16:44.550 --> 16:45.550
<b>Mom.</b>

16:45.590 --> 16:48.970
<b>Can he do it when he comes
back from camping...?</b>

16:51.010 --> 16:53.800
<b>I... I guess not, huh.</b>

16:54.060 --> 16:55.640
<b>I'll make him do it.</b>

16:55.770 --> 16:58.230
<b>Yeah, yeah, yeah...</b>

16:58.350 --> 16:59.560
<b><i>Continuing...</i></b>

16:59.690 --> 17:02.690
<b><i>News about a shipwreck off
the coast of Bermuda.</i></b>

17:02.810 --> 17:03.900
<b><i>Early yesterday morning...</i></b>

17:04.020 --> 17:08.150
<b><i>The sunken ship, on which salvage operations
had begun, seems to have disappeared.</i></b>

17:08.280 --> 17:10.450
<b><i>The cause is unknown.</i></b>

17:10.570 --> 17:12.160
<b>Oh my...</b>

17:15.580 --> 17:17.120
<b>Giaaan!</b>

17:18.200 --> 17:20.330
<b>What's with the hurry?!</b>

17:20.500 --> 17:24.090
<b>Did you see the news?
The treasure ship has disappeared!</b>

17:24.210 --> 17:26.250
<b>Ah, seems so.</b>

17:26.380 --> 17:29.760
<b>How are you so calm?
The ocean is vast, you know?</b>

17:29.880 --> 17:31.300
<b>When something goes missing,</b>

17:31.430 --> 17:33.720
<b>it's not something you can easily find!</b>

17:33.840 --> 17:36.100
<b>Ya don't have 'ta state the obvious!</b>

17:36.680 --> 17:38.600
<b>That... is... why...!</b>

17:38.720 --> 17:41.140
<b>We'll find the ship ourselves!</b>

17:43.190 --> 17:47.730
<b>If we received 10% of the 20 trillion yen as a reward...</b>

17:47.860 --> 17:49.570
<b>We'd get 2 trillion yen!</b>

17:55.200 --> 17:57.330
<b>2 trillion yen?!</b>

18:00.250 --> 18:03.250
<b>Hey, when are we going camping?</b>

18:05.540 --> 18:07.210
<b>About that...</b>

18:09.170 --> 18:11.960
<b>Huh? You're all here?</b>

18:15.550 --> 18:18.310
<b>Nobita-san, Dora-chan told us everything.</b>

18:18.430 --> 18:21.430
<b>We can't go camping till
you finish your homework?!</b>

18:21.560 --> 18:23.600
<b>Hurry and finish it!</b>

18:23.730 --> 18:26.770
<b>It's impossible for me to finish it.</b>

18:26.900 --> 18:29.070
<b>I'll explain anything you
don't understand.</b>

18:29.190 --> 18:32.110
<b>- Really?
- Yeah, so do your best.</b>

18:32.240 --> 18:35.870
<b>The sea floor is a mysterious world!
Dreams and adventures await us!</b>

18:35.990 --> 18:38.580
<b>That makes me motivated!</b>

18:38.700 --> 18:40.790
<b>Then, get on with it!</b>

18:41.330 --> 18:43.080
<b>O-Okay!</b>

18:51.090 --> 18:53.720
<b>Oh, perfect. This is about the deep sea.</b>

18:53.840 --> 18:55.220
<b>The anglerfish...</b>

18:55.340 --> 18:58.300
<b>uses its light to lure creatures that become its prey.</b>

18:58.430 --> 19:01.310
<b>- You wanna see the real thing, right?
- I want to! I want to!</b>

19:01.430 --> 19:03.480
<b>Don't stop, or I'll hit ya!</b>

19:06.520 --> 19:10.440
<b>Everyone's working towards a single goal.</b>

19:10.570 --> 19:12.900
<b>How wonderful.</b>

19:17.110 --> 19:19.950
<b>Mom, Mom!
Look!</b>

19:20.080 --> 19:21.660
<b>My homework is done!</b>

19:21.790 --> 19:22.870
<b>Oh?</b>

19:33.880 --> 19:36.760
<b>You did a great job.
You can do it if you try!</b>

19:37.680 --> 19:39.720
<b>Can I go camping?</b>

19:39.970 --> 19:42.770
<b>Yes! Have fun!</b>

19:43.100 --> 19:44.640
<b>Yay!</b>

19:44.770 --> 19:46.390
<b>- Yay!
- Alright!</b>

19:46.520 --> 19:47.980
<b>- Dora-chan.
- Hm?</b>

19:48.100 --> 19:49.650
<b>Take care of them, okay?</b>

19:50.060 --> 19:51.770
<b>You got it, Mom!</b>

20:06.060 --> 20:07.590
<b>Radar contact ahead, Captain.</b>

20:08.690 --> 20:09.800
<b>I'm checking it out now!</b>

20:10.150 --> 20:11.970
<b>Get them on the radio, immediately!</b>

20:12.070 --> 20:13.840
<b>Aye, sir. Trying to raise them now.</b>

20:16.490 --> 20:17.760
<b>It's a sailing vessel, sir!</b>

20:17.860 --> 20:19.770
<b>No response on radio, sir. Still nothing.</b>

20:20.160 --> 20:21.520
<b>Sound the danger signal!</b>

20:21.620 --> 20:22.270
<b>Aye, sir!</b>

20:22.450 --> 20:24.310
<b>Hard to starboard!</b>

20:27.790 --> 20:29.610
<b>All hands on deck! Brace for impact!</b>

20:29.830 --> 20:32.400
<b>And hurry! As soon as possible. Now, now!</b>

20:49.120 --> 20:50.120
<b>Off the coast of Brazil,</b>

20:50.170 --> 20:53.290
<b>the Queen Elise made contact with a sailing ship</b>

20:53.420 --> 20:55.760
<b>According to the ship's captain,</b>

20:55.880 --> 21:00.180
<b>based off the sailing ship's trajectory and speed,
it is unlikely to be an abandoned vessel.</b>

21:00.300 --> 21:01.760
<b>That's creepy.</b>

21:01.890 --> 21:03.430
<b>The sea is scary, huh?</b>

21:04.390 --> 21:06.220
<b>- Nobita-saaan!
- Nobita!</b>

21:06.350 --> 21:07.770
<b>Nobita!</b>

21:07.890 --> 21:10.390
<b>W-We're off!</b>

21:10.520 --> 21:12.730
<b>- Be careful.
- Have a nice trip.</b>

21:12.860 --> 21:14.520
<b>Isn't this great?</b>

21:14.650 --> 21:16.110
<b>- Yo!
- Good morning!</b>

21:16.230 --> 21:18.150
<b>Shh! Things are looking stormy.</b>

21:18.280 --> 21:20.650
<b>Everyone, over here!</b>

21:21.820 --> 21:24.160
<b>But it's bright and sunny?</b>

21:25.580 --> 21:27.870
<b>- What's wrong?
- Why are you so restless?</b>

21:28.000 --> 21:30.580
<b>We need to go before
Mom's mood changes!</b>

21:31.920 --> 21:33.420
<b>Let's hurry and go!</b>

21:35.800 --> 21:38.510
<b>But... uwah!
We're already at the ocean!</b>

21:38.630 --> 21:40.300
<b>What's goin' on, Doraemon?!</b>

21:40.420 --> 21:43.260
<b>- Don't worry about it!
- Let's go!</b>

21:49.520 --> 21:53.520
<b>Now, let's begin our journey to the sea floor!</b>

21:56.820 --> 22:00.070
<b>It's fine, just try breathing.</b>

22:00.650 --> 22:03.160
<b>- Amazing!
- I can breathe!</b>

22:03.280 --> 22:05.240
<b>It's thanks to the Adapting Light!</b>

22:05.370 --> 22:08.330
<b>Welcome to the heart of the Pacific Ocean!</b>

22:08.450 --> 22:10.000
<b>So many fish!</b>

22:10.120 --> 22:12.710
<b>It's like a giant aquarium!</b>

22:12.830 --> 22:15.840
<b>It's such a luxury to be this close... Hm?</b>

22:21.170 --> 22:24.720
<b>It's like it's blessing our departure!</b>

22:24.890 --> 22:27.640
<b>That was a great sight.</b>

22:30.220 --> 22:32.100
<b>What's this?</b>

22:32.230 --> 22:34.900
<b>Shizuka-chan, it's the Underwater Buggy.</b>

22:35.020 --> 22:37.020
<b>Nobita's friend, Shizuka-san?</b>

22:37.150 --> 22:39.440
<b>- You can talk?!
- Yes.</b>

22:39.570 --> 22:41.650
<b>Why are you being that casual with me?!</b>

22:39.570 --> 22:43.650
(Not using honorifics (san/kun) with people you
aren't close to is considered rude.)

22:41.780 --> 22:43.650
<b>What's your name?</b>

22:43.780 --> 22:47.160
<b>My chassis number is S83-312.</b>

22:47.280 --> 22:50.740
<b>My model name is "Underwater Variable Size Buggy Car"</b>

22:52.290 --> 22:54.790
<b>So, can I call you Buggy-chan?</b>

22:54.920 --> 22:56.630
<b>Buggy-chan...?</b>

22:56.750 --> 22:59.420
<b>Yeah!
Nice to meet you, Buggy-chan!</b>

22:59.550 --> 23:00.750
<b>- Nice 'ta meet ya.
- Nice to meet you!</b>

23:00.880 --> 23:02.130
<b>It is nice to meet you.</b>

23:02.260 --> 23:03.800
<b>Take us to that place.</b>

23:03.920 --> 23:05.970
<b>Understood.</b>

23:08.050 --> 23:10.060
<b>Please hold on tight.</b>

23:15.690 --> 23:17.690
<b>Let's go!</b>

23:26.360 --> 23:28.990
<b>Wow!
Hey, what's that?</b>

23:29.120 --> 23:30.990
<b>A goblin shark.</b>

23:31.120 --> 23:34.710
<b>It can open its jaw wide, and the
speed at which it lunges is about</b>

23:34.830 --> 23:36.460
<b>3 meters per second.</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:37.750
<b>Is it fast?</b>

23:37.880 --> 23:39.920
<b>Compared to me, no.</b>

23:40.040 --> 23:42.380
<b>Look, something's hanging off that.</b>

23:42.500 --> 23:43.880
<b>A Gibberichthys latifrons.</b>

23:44.010 --> 23:46.630
<b>Sounds like some kinda food!</b>

23:46.760 --> 23:48.090
<b>Buggy, what's that?</b>

23:48.220 --> 23:49.640
<b>Is it walking?</b>

23:49.760 --> 23:51.560
<b>Is it a fish?!</b>

23:51.680 --> 23:54.100
<b>That is a sea toad.</b>

23:54.220 --> 23:55.390
<b>Cute!</b>

23:55.520 --> 23:57.020
<b>Nobita, there!</b>

23:58.480 --> 24:00.480
<b>It's a Pacific footballfish!</b>

24:00.610 --> 24:03.230
<b>Even you know some, Nobita?</b>

24:03.360 --> 24:05.820
<b>- D-Don't make fun  of me!
- Hahahah!</b>

24:05.950 --> 24:09.070
<b>Hey, let's go to the Bermuda Triangle!</b>

24:09.200 --> 24:10.160
<b>What's that?</b>

24:10.280 --> 24:12.240
<b>Let's go find that lost treasure!</b>

24:12.370 --> 24:14.910
<b>If we find it, we'll get 2 trillion yen!</b>

24:15.040 --> 24:16.290
<b>2 trillion yen?!</b>

24:16.410 --> 24:20.880
<b>Bermuda? No way!
It's on the other side of the planet!</b>

24:21.000 --> 24:23.210
<b>We can't go that far!</b>

24:23.340 --> 24:25.840
<b>I can do it in a day.</b>

24:25.970 --> 24:27.550
<b>- Really?!
- Wow!</b>

24:27.680 --> 24:29.550
<b>No means no!</b>

24:29.680 --> 24:32.140
<b>We've already decided on where we're staying for the night.</b>

24:34.100 --> 24:36.980
<b>If you want to go on a treasure
hunt that badly...</b>

24:38.980 --> 24:41.310
<b>Treasure Hunt Counter!</b>

24:41.860 --> 24:45.280
<b>There are precious rare metals in the seabed.</b>

24:45.650 --> 24:47.190
<b>Rare metals?</b>

24:47.320 --> 24:49.910
<b>They're used in electronics.</b>

24:50.030 --> 24:53.080
<b>They're metals that are sold for a high price.</b>

24:53.200 --> 24:55.160
<b>Examples include manganese and gold.</b>

24:55.290 --> 24:56.250
<b>Gold?!</b>

24:56.370 --> 25:00.120
<b>It'll tell you if there's
treasure within 100 meters.</b>

25:00.250 --> 25:02.500
<b>Alright! Let's find 'em all!</b>

25:06.630 --> 25:09.430
<b>Oh treasure, where are you~?</b>

25:09.970 --> 25:12.720
<b>This is exciting, isn't it?</b>

25:12.850 --> 25:15.390
<b>We might become super-rich!</b>

25:17.430 --> 25:19.440
<b>Oh, did I find it?!</b>

25:25.320 --> 25:26.900
<b>It's here...?!</b>

25:31.280 --> 25:32.410
<b>A tire?!</b>

25:38.950 --> 25:40.330
<b>A plastic bag...</b>

25:45.540 --> 25:46.750
<b>A plastic bottle...</b>

25:47.500 --> 25:50.590
<b>Seriously! Is the ocean one big trash can?!</b>

25:50.720 --> 25:53.720
<b>Doraemon, this gadget isn't broken, is it?!</b>

25:53.840 --> 25:55.180
<b>Come on...</b>

25:55.300 --> 25:57.470
<b>They must have been dropped
from the surface, correct?</b>

25:57.600 --> 26:00.020
<b>Plastics do not decompose in the soil.</b>

26:00.140 --> 26:02.270
<b>They will remain for a long time.</b>

26:14.280 --> 26:15.950
<b>That's strange...</b>

26:16.080 --> 26:17.870
<b>Everyone!</b>

26:18.700 --> 26:22.040
<b>This is big! Look at this!</b>

26:23.370 --> 26:25.540
<b>It's a rare metal! A rare metal!</b>

26:26.340 --> 26:27.670
<b>Wow, amazing!</b>

26:27.800 --> 26:30.010
<b>- Seriously?
- Ya did it!</b>

26:30.130 --> 26:32.260
<b>Buggy, can you analyze it?</b>

26:32.380 --> 26:33.970
<b>Of course.</b>

26:34.090 --> 26:37.970
<b>The material is an alloy of palladium,
nickel, molybdenum, chromium,</b>

26:38.100 --> 26:40.470
<b>stainless steel, and titanium.</b>

26:41.020 --> 26:45.270
<b>However, judging by the level of corrosion,
I estimate it is about 7,000 years old.</b>

26:45.400 --> 26:47.400
<b>7,000 years old?!</b>

26:47.520 --> 26:49.980
<b>However, it is a genuine rare metal.</b>

26:50.110 --> 26:51.940
<b>- Woah!
- Really?!</b>

26:52.070 --> 26:53.320
<b>Amazing!</b>

26:53.450 --> 26:54.360
<b>Yay!</b>

26:54.490 --> 26:56.370
<b>Let me touch it!</b>

26:56.490 --> 26:57.700
<b>This is crazy!</b>

26:57.830 --> 26:59.620
<b>There must be some mistake.</b>

26:59.740 --> 27:02.450
<b>There's no way something like
that existed 7,000 years ago.</b>

27:02.580 --> 27:04.830
<b>But that is what the analysis results show.</b>

27:08.420 --> 27:11.170
<b>I have received an alarm
about volcanic activity.</b>

27:11.300 --> 27:14.170
<b>Activating self-defense program.</b>

27:14.590 --> 27:19.140
<b>The shaking will commence in 3, 2, 1...</b>

27:22.890 --> 27:24.730
<b>It's an earthquake!</b>

27:26.150 --> 27:27.980
<b>Everyone, get on!</b>

27:28.110 --> 27:30.610
<b>Hurry!</b>

27:41.870 --> 27:44.250
<b>Hey! We'll get crushed!</b>

27:44.370 --> 27:47.880
<b>Shut up! Do not waste my memory!</b>

27:48.380 --> 27:50.250
<b>Buggy! Forward! Forward!</b>

27:58.550 --> 28:01.430
<b>- Nobita-san!
- Nobita!</b>

28:05.890 --> 28:08.270
<b>A... A squid?!</b>

28:12.190 --> 28:15.900
<b>Go back! There was a huge squid!
It was dozens of meters long!</b>

28:16.030 --> 28:18.160
<b>Why're ya talkin' about
that at a time like this?!</b>

28:18.280 --> 28:21.410
<b>Don't ask the impossible!
Buggy, get us somewhere safe, quick!</b>

28:21.700 --> 28:23.830
<b>I am on my way right now!</b>

28:31.080 --> 28:34.300
<b>We should be safe now that we're this far.</b>

28:34.500 --> 28:35.800
<b>Hey, look!</b>

28:36.420 --> 28:39.180
<b>Ah, it's our mountain!</b>

28:48.810 --> 28:50.250
<b>We've arrived.</b>

28:53.190 --> 28:54.730
<b>Amazing!</b>

28:54.860 --> 28:56.530
<b>So many!</b>

28:56.650 --> 28:58.150
<b>Why only here?</b>

28:58.280 --> 29:01.030
<b>I've lured them over with the Delicious Clam.</b>

29:01.990 --> 29:04.990
<b>Ah! Hey, doesn't that one look like Doraemon?</b>

29:05.120 --> 29:07.620
<b>Oh, it does!</b>

29:08.290 --> 29:09.620
<b>They look alike!</b>

29:10.500 --> 29:12.170
<b>We don't!</b>

29:14.340 --> 29:15.920
<b>Ah, this little one is?</b>

29:16.050 --> 29:19.590
<b>That is a leftvent seadevil.
A male is attached to its body.</b>

29:19.880 --> 29:21.510
<b>It will never leave it again.</b>

29:21.640 --> 29:22.970
<b>What's that?</b>

29:23.100 --> 29:26.560
<b>Deep-sea creatures are all
so interesting, aren't they?!</b>

29:27.100 --> 29:29.180
<b>Let's camp here today...</b>

29:31.230 --> 29:33.770
Tent Apartment!

29:34.230 --> 29:36.070
<b>When you inflate it...</b>

29:43.120 --> 29:44.660
<b>Now, come on in, come on in.</b>

29:46.080 --> 29:47.870
<b>This is the living room.</b>

29:48.000 --> 29:49.750
<b>Wow!</b>

29:49.870 --> 29:51.080
<b>- It's nice!
- Pretty!</b>

29:51.210 --> 29:52.920
<b>Well, it's a pretty decent grade.</b>

29:53.040 --> 29:54.710
<b>There are private rooms too.</b>

29:55.340 --> 29:59.170
<b>Hahah! It's so fluffy!</b>

29:59.300 --> 30:00.840
<b>So, this is Gian's bed now, huh?</b>

30:00.970 --> 30:02.430
<b>We can go outside.</b>

30:02.550 --> 30:05.140
<b>There's one important thing
I need to tell you.</b>

30:05.390 --> 30:09.600
<b>It'll be bad if you forgot about
this while living underwater.</b>

30:10.060 --> 30:12.060
<b>- Huh?
- Hm?</b>

30:12.690 --> 30:15.520
<b>First, when you enter,
close the door behind you.</b>

30:15.860 --> 30:18.360
<b>Press this button.</b>

30:19.530 --> 30:23.070
<b>Wait until all the water has
drained before defecating.</b>

30:24.700 --> 30:27.160
<b>Oh, you're talking about the toilet.</b>

30:27.410 --> 30:28.740
<b>This is serious!</b>

30:28.870 --> 30:33.370
<b>Just try doing it in the water!
It'll mix with the surrounding water...</b>

30:41.050 --> 30:42.720
<b>Dora-chan, the shower is...?</b>

30:42.840 --> 30:45.010
<b>We're already underwater.</b>

30:45.140 --> 30:47.010
<b>Oh, right.</b>

30:47.140 --> 30:50.100
<b>Now, let's have a barbecue for dinner.</b>

30:50.220 --> 30:52.310
<b>Barbecue?!</b>

30:52.430 --> 30:54.520
<b>In the Underwater Cooking Machine,</b>

30:54.640 --> 30:57.810
<b>insert the barbecue order card...</b>

30:58.440 --> 31:00.280
<b>Wait three minutes.</b>

31:09.790 --> 31:12.500
<b>How did you start a fire underwater?</b>

31:12.620 --> 31:14.620
<b>It's an Underwater Campfire.</b>

31:15.000 --> 31:17.670
<b>But the brightness doesn't
really fit the mood, does it?</b>

31:17.790 --> 31:19.630
<b>What is a 'mood'?</b>

31:19.750 --> 31:22.630
<b>Hmm... how do I explain it...?</b>

31:22.760 --> 31:25.220
<b>Oh! I almost forgot.</b>

31:27.470 --> 31:29.100
<b>Lights-Out Bulb!</b>

31:29.220 --> 31:31.720
<b>Um... here should do.</b>

31:33.390 --> 31:36.770
<b>When you put this on,
the surroundings become dark.</b>

31:46.700 --> 31:47.700
<b>Pretty...</b>

31:47.820 --> 31:49.740
<b>The mood has gotten way better!</b>

31:53.660 --> 31:56.250
<b>Mood... you say.</b>

32:03.420 --> 32:04.970
<b>Mmm... delicious!</b>

32:05.090 --> 32:06.880
<b>This is good quality meat!</b>

32:07.010 --> 32:08.590
<b>It's so soft.</b>

32:08.720 --> 32:11.970
<b>It looks like meat, but it's actually
made of processed plankton.</b>

32:12.100 --> 32:14.180
<b>Huh?! From that Delicious Clam?</b>

32:14.310 --> 32:16.690
<b>Yep, they're edible.</b>

32:16.810 --> 32:19.560
<b>Woah... it definitely looks like meat to me.</b>

32:19.690 --> 32:22.070
<b>This is the first time I've
eaten something like this!</b>

32:22.940 --> 32:25.690
<b>Whatever it is,
it's delicious!</b>

32:25.820 --> 32:26.820
<b>Yeah!</b>

32:26.860 --> 32:29.490
<b>It's similar to the filet mignon I ate in France!</b>

32:29.610 --> 32:31.950
<b>Hey, what are we doing tomorrow?</b>

32:32.080 --> 32:34.040
<b>Let's search for that ship in the Bermuda Triangle!</b>

32:34.160 --> 32:35.160
<b>No way!</b>

32:35.290 --> 32:36.870
<b>But why...?</b>

32:37.000 --> 32:39.000
<b>Hey, where exactly is that?</b>

32:39.120 --> 32:43.500
<b>From here, we would have to
cross America to reach it.</b>

32:43.920 --> 32:48.010
<b>But it's strange, isn't it?
That a sunken ship just disappeared.</b>

32:48.130 --> 32:51.390
<b>In Bermuda, anything is possible.</b>

32:51.510 --> 32:52.760
<b>Why?</b>

32:52.890 --> 32:55.850
<b>Haven't you heard of the Devil's Triangle?</b>

32:55.970 --> 33:01.150
<b>For many years, numerous ships and
airplanes have disappeared in that area.</b>

33:01.270 --> 33:02.480
<b>Huh?</b>

33:02.610 --> 33:04.480
<b>Where do they go after disappearing?</b>

33:04.610 --> 33:06.110
<b>There are various theories!</b>

33:06.230 --> 33:10.110
<b>Like it being a gateway to the fourth
dimension or them being abducted by aliens.</b>

33:10.240 --> 33:11.260
<b>Aliens?!</b>

33:11.620 --> 33:15.410
<b>Why don't we try and solve that mystery together?</b>

33:15.660 --> 33:18.710
<b>You say that, but you're after
the treasure, aren't you?</b>

33:18.830 --> 33:21.500
<b>No matter how many times you say it,
no means no!</b>

33:22.000 --> 33:24.960
<b>What a hard-headed jerk!</b>

33:25.090 --> 33:27.380
<b>It'll be too late once we get into trouble!</b>

33:27.510 --> 33:29.340
<b>Now, now...</b>

33:35.510 --> 33:37.850
<b>Mm... Mommy...</b>

33:48.570 --> 33:52.360
<b>Ah... why do I have to sleep with Buggy...</b>

33:52.610 --> 33:55.580
<b>All cuz I lost at rock-paper-scissors...</b>

33:56.410 --> 33:59.040
<b>This is my first time sleeping
with a human.</b>

34:00.830 --> 34:03.750
<b>I'm sleeping now.
Good night.</b>

34:04.500 --> 34:06.630
<b>Good night.</b>

34:12.720 --> 34:14.090
<b>Buggy?!</b>

34:17.510 --> 34:21.270
<b>Geez, and I thought I was a bad sleeper.</b>

34:32.700 --> 34:34.950
<b>This is a disaster!</b>

34:35.870 --> 34:37.990
<b>Gian and Suneo are missing!</b>

34:38.120 --> 34:39.450
<b>What happened?</b>

34:39.580 --> 34:41.120
<b>Where did they go?!</b>

34:41.910 --> 34:44.540
<b>Huh? Where's Buggy?</b>

34:44.670 --> 34:48.130
<b>Gwahahahahah!
We're gonna become filthy rich!</b>

34:48.250 --> 34:51.720
<b>Is it really possible 'ta
get there in a single day?</b>

34:51.840 --> 34:53.760
<b>I am very fast...</b>

34:53.880 --> 34:56.720
<b>But are you really sure?</b>

34:57.050 --> 34:58.470
<b>Of course!</b>

34:58.600 --> 35:03.100
<b>Boys like us aren't afraid
of a little danger, right?!</b>

35:08.770 --> 35:10.610
<b>They left here three hours ago!</b>

35:10.820 --> 35:13.900
<b>This is bad, this is really bad!</b>

35:14.030 --> 35:16.530
<b>What's so bad about it?</b>

35:17.120 --> 35:19.280
<b>The effect of the Adapting Light
only lasts for 24 hours!</b>

35:19.990 --> 35:22.250
<b>There's less than 30 minutes left!</b>

35:28.630 --> 35:31.760
<b>Hm? Hey, it's getting kinda dark...</b>

35:31.880 --> 35:35.720
<b>Come to think of it...
Huh? It's hard to breathe...</b>

35:35.840 --> 35:39.220
<b>The effect of the Adapting Light
is beginning to wear off.</b>

35:40.560 --> 35:42.720
<b>Th-Then...!</b>

35:42.970 --> 35:47.690
<b>Let's follow them!
They're probably heading for the Bermuda Triangle!</b>

35:48.060 --> 35:50.230
<b>What happens when the effect wears off?!</b>

35:50.360 --> 35:53.190
<b>It will become pitch-black and
you will not be able to breathe.</b>

35:53.320 --> 35:55.990
<b>The immense water pressure will completely crush you.</b>

35:57.780 --> 35:59.660
<b>Why didn't you tell us?!</b>

35:59.780 --> 36:01.910
<b>I asked, "Are you really sure?"</b>

36:02.040 --> 36:03.910
<b>But you said you "aren't afraid of a little danger"...</b>

36:04.040 --> 36:06.160
<b>Quit screwin' around!</b>

36:06.460 --> 36:09.210
<b>Mommy!</b>

36:11.750 --> 36:12.800
<b>I know!</b>

36:12.920 --> 36:15.920
<b>I wonder if we can use the Obtaining Bag?</b>

36:16.050 --> 36:19.720
<b>It won't work!
Buggy is speeding along at breakneck speeds!</b>

36:19.840 --> 36:22.930
<b>It's like trying to catch a speeding
bullet with your bare hands!</b>

36:23.060 --> 36:24.640
<b>The Anywhere Door?</b>

36:24.770 --> 36:27.020
<b>It's still sitting above the sea.</b>

36:27.310 --> 36:30.480
<b>We can't get it back in 30 minutes!</b>

36:33.780 --> 36:35.570
<b>It's pitch black...</b>

36:35.690 --> 36:37.400
<b>I can't see a thing...</b>

36:40.490 --> 36:42.580
<b>Nobita-kun!</b>

36:43.030 --> 36:45.910
<b>The motors are redlining...</b>

36:47.330 --> 36:51.580
<b>We will soon cross the Eastern Pacific Rise.</b>

37:00.430 --> 37:02.180
<b>They fell off...</b>

37:04.890 --> 37:06.020
<b>Are you going to die?</b>

37:07.770 --> 37:09.770
<b>Humans are arrogant, but...</b>

37:09.890 --> 37:13.270
<b>They are quite weak creatures, are they not?</b>

37:19.030 --> 37:20.360
<b>Doraemon!</b>

37:20.910 --> 37:22.570
<b>What's wrong?</b>

37:24.870 --> 37:26.290
<b>Doraemon!</b>

37:26.410 --> 37:28.660
<b>Time's... up.</b>

37:28.790 --> 37:29.750
<b>- Huh?!
- Come on!</b>

37:29.870 --> 37:33.670
<b>It's my fault!
I'll break myself as punishment!</b>

37:36.840 --> 37:38.300
<b>Calm down!</b>

37:38.420 --> 37:40.680
<b>This won't solve anything!</b>

37:40.800 --> 37:44.970
<b>If I'd just been more careful,
we could've gotten them back... Hm?</b>

37:46.470 --> 37:48.520
<b>We could've used the Obtaining Bag...</b>

37:48.640 --> 37:51.440
<b>to obtain the Anywhere Door.</b>

37:51.560 --> 37:54.440
<b>Why didn't you think of that sooner?!</b>

37:54.560 --> 37:55.820
<b>Calm down, Nobita-san!</b>

38:01.570 --> 38:03.700
<b>- I can hear something.
- You can?</b>

38:06.330 --> 38:09.580
<b>It's from the direction the two of them went in.</b>

38:17.050 --> 38:19.260
<b>What happened?</b>

38:19.380 --> 38:20.720
<b>Buggy!</b>

38:21.090 --> 38:23.680
<b>Buggy! Are you alright?</b>

38:24.340 --> 38:26.100
<b>Gian! Suneo!</b>

38:30.980 --> 38:32.520
<b>Gian! Suneo!</b>

38:35.060 --> 38:38.440
<b>They haven't been flattened by the water pressure...
Why?</b>

38:41.570 --> 38:44.200
<b>God, please!</b>

38:44.780 --> 38:47.870
<b>Unless you want to hear Gian's terrible, awful singing...</b>

38:47.990 --> 38:50.500
<b>Please save him!</b>

38:52.500 --> 38:54.170
<b>Nobita-kun...</b>

38:54.290 --> 38:56.920
<b>Who said my singing is terrible and awful... hey!</b>

38:57.040 --> 39:00.260
<b>- Hm? Gian!
- Suneo-san!</b>

39:02.220 --> 39:04.220
<b>You're both alive!</b>

39:04.340 --> 39:07.010
<b>Uh... yeah, I guess we're still alive.</b>

39:07.140 --> 39:08.140
<b>It's a miracle!</b>

39:08.260 --> 39:10.310
<b>You're so clumsy, Doraemon.</b>

39:10.430 --> 39:12.430
<b>The effect of the Adapting Light isn't over, right?</b>

39:12.560 --> 39:15.310
<b>That can't be...</b>

39:16.310 --> 39:18.190
<b>We had an awful experience cuz of him!</b>

39:18.310 --> 39:20.820
<b>I went because I was ordered to go.</b>

39:20.940 --> 39:22.400
<b>I even asked for confirmation.</b>

39:22.530 --> 39:23.320
<b>What did you say?!</b>

39:23.440 --> 39:26.030
<b>Yer pretty cheeky fer a second-hand buggy!</b>

39:26.160 --> 39:26.870
<b>Hey!</b>

39:26.990 --> 39:30.830
<b>Now you've done it.
Humans are always like this.</b>

39:30.950 --> 39:32.160
<b>Ya wanna fight?</b>

39:32.290 --> 39:35.540
<b>I'm gonna beat ya to a pulp!</b>

39:35.670 --> 39:37.790
<b>If you can.</b>

39:37.920 --> 39:39.380
<b>Wait! Calm down!</b>

39:39.500 --> 39:41.460
<b>Stop! Both of you!</b>

39:41.590 --> 39:43.260
<b>Buggy-chan is right!</b>

39:43.380 --> 39:46.220
<b>It isn't his fault for doing as he was told!</b>

39:46.340 --> 39:47.760
<b>Shizuka-san...</b>

39:48.140 --> 39:51.430
<b>Isn't it your fault for going without
telling us in the first place?!</b>

39:51.560 --> 39:55.440
<b>I hope you two never do something this rash again!</b>

39:55.560 --> 39:57.310
<b>We were wrong...</b>

39:57.440 --> 39:58.810
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

39:59.560 --> 40:03.570
<b>Alright!
That settles it then.</b>

40:12.370 --> 40:14.830
<b>We've arrived! We're at the Mariana Trench.</b>

40:14.950 --> 40:16.540
<b>That famous one?</b>

40:16.660 --> 40:17.870
<b>What's this?</b>

40:18.000 --> 40:20.840
<b>A trench is a valley on the ocean floor.</b>

40:20.960 --> 40:24.840
<b>This is the Mariana Trench, the deepest in the world.</b>

40:26.340 --> 40:28.010
<b>Come, let's go!</b>

40:28.130 --> 40:29.930
<b>- Yahoo!
- Hold on!</b>

40:31.760 --> 40:33.350
<b>Huh?! Buggy, wait!</b>

40:33.470 --> 40:35.140
<b>No way!</b>

40:41.900 --> 40:45.940
(11km or 6.8 miles)

40:41.900 --> 40:45.940
<b>The Mariana Trench is approximately 11,000 meters deep.</b>

40:46.070 --> 40:47.990
<b>You'd have to stack Mt. Fuji atop Mt. Everest</b>

40:48.110 --> 40:50.280
<b>at the bottom to see their peaks from the top.</b>

40:50.410 --> 40:52.280
<b>Hm... I don't get it.</b>

40:52.910 --> 40:55.620
<b>The deepest dive ever recorded by a human is</b>

40:55.750 --> 40:57.250
<b>approximately 10,000 meters.</b>

40:57.620 --> 41:00.250
<b>We're gonna surpass that record!</b>

41:02.380 --> 41:04.630
<b>To a place nobody's been to before!</b>

41:04.750 --> 41:06.630
<b>We're going there!</b>

41:06.760 --> 41:09.720
<b>That's right!</b>

41:19.230 --> 41:22.020
<b>Ladies and gentlemen!
Welcome to the deepest point on Earth!</b>

41:24.150 --> 41:26.360
<b>It doesn't feel that different.</b>

41:29.650 --> 41:32.780
<b>The top is blurry and hard to see.</b>

41:33.200 --> 41:36.740
<b>Hey, hey, hey! Since we're here,
let's take a commemorative photo!</b>

41:36.870 --> 41:37.910
<b>Sounds good!</b>

41:38.040 --> 41:41.000
<b>It'll be proof that we've reached the deepest part!</b>

41:41.120 --> 41:43.210
<b>Deep Sea Camera!</b>

41:43.330 --> 41:45.290
<b>Humans are inconvenient, aren't they?</b>

41:45.420 --> 41:49.090
<b>If you record it in the memory of an electronic
brain, then you can view it anytime, right?</b>

41:49.220 --> 41:51.180
<b>We can't do it like you.</b>

41:51.300 --> 41:53.510
<b>Seriously, yer ruinin' the mood.</b>

41:53.640 --> 41:58.180
<b>Since memories are unreliable, we preserve them by turning them into tangible things.</b>

41:58.390 --> 42:01.600
<b>Now, cheese!</b>

42:09.530 --> 42:10.740
<b>It's good!</b>

42:10.860 --> 42:12.070
<b>Perfect!</b>

42:12.200 --> 42:14.490
<b>Make some copies for us later!</b>

42:14.620 --> 42:15.320
<b>Yeah!</b>

42:15.450 --> 42:17.700
<b>Alright, Suneo. Let's go exploring!</b>

42:17.830 --> 42:18.870
<b>Okay!</b>

42:19.000 --> 42:20.120
<b>Hey, Dora-chan.</b>

42:20.250 --> 42:22.580
<b>Is it fine if I take some sand as a souvenir?</b>

42:23.620 --> 42:26.040
<b>See? Photos are good too, right?</b>

42:28.590 --> 42:31.420
<b>- Hey!
- Hm?</b>

42:31.550 --> 42:33.930
<b>Everyone, come here!</b>

42:34.260 --> 42:36.010
<b>What happened?</b>

42:37.760 --> 42:40.350
<b>Hey, look at this!</b>

42:40.680 --> 42:42.350
<b>This is a great discovery!</b>

42:45.480 --> 42:48.900
<b>There's no mistaking it!
It's the same ship I saw on the news!</b>

42:49.030 --> 42:50.650
<b>Let's check it out!</b>

42:50.780 --> 42:51.740
<b>Wait!</b>

42:51.860 --> 42:53.360
<b>Let's go too, Nobita-san!</b>

42:53.490 --> 42:55.740
<b>Huh?! It's dangerous!</b>

42:57.700 --> 42:59.910
<b>I'm going too!</b>

43:10.840 --> 43:13.550
<b>It's in pretty bad shape.</b>

43:14.050 --> 43:17.720
<b>Oh, it's open!
Looks like we can go inside through here.</b>

43:17.850 --> 43:19.640
<b>Where's the treasure?</b>

43:19.760 --> 43:21.520
<b>20 trillion yen~</b>

43:21.640 --> 43:24.350
<b>- It's a little scary.
- Geez...</b>

43:24.480 --> 43:26.560
<b>Hey, there might be something weird around.</b>

43:26.690 --> 43:29.230
<b>Just wait there, ya coward!</b>

43:29.520 --> 43:31.860
<b>There's no way I'm going in!</b>

43:31.980 --> 43:34.150
<b>Do whatever you want!</b>

43:37.160 --> 43:39.330
<b>The insides are pretty run-down.</b>

43:40.870 --> 43:42.120
<b>This is...</b>

43:43.660 --> 43:46.040
<b>- ...gold, isn't it?!
- Huh?!</b>

43:46.170 --> 43:47.710
<b>Lemme see.</b>

43:50.170 --> 43:51.420
<b>It's real!</b>

43:51.550 --> 43:53.840
<b>I wonder if someone has already taken the rest?</b>

43:53.970 --> 43:55.930
<b>Come on, ya gotta be kiddin' me!</b>

43:56.050 --> 43:58.590
<b>There must be more.
Let's find it, Suneo!</b>

43:58.720 --> 44:00.010
<b>Yeah!</b>

44:08.940 --> 44:11.190
<b>Can I ask you something?</b>

44:11.320 --> 44:12.610
<b>What?</b>

44:15.400 --> 44:18.320
<b>Why did Shizuka-san protect me?</b>

44:19.030 --> 44:22.410
<b>I was never treated like that by my previous owners.</b>

44:23.080 --> 44:25.080
<b>I guess she couldn't just leave you alone?</b>

44:25.200 --> 44:27.370
<b>Shizuka-chan is a kind girl.</b>

44:27.790 --> 44:29.540
<b>Couldn't leave me alone...</b>

44:29.670 --> 44:32.800
<b>- Something's here!
- Eek!</b>

44:32.960 --> 44:34.710
<b>S... S-S-S...</b>

44:34.840 --> 44:36.800
<b>Skeleton?!</b>

44:39.220 --> 44:43.680
<b>It looks quite old.
It might've been one of the ship's crew members.</b>

44:44.020 --> 44:46.520
<b>Hey, everyone!</b>

44:47.690 --> 44:50.440
<b>Did something happen?!</b>

44:50.980 --> 44:53.360
<b>Are you alright...?!</b>

44:59.110 --> 45:00.530
<b>S-Something's here!</b>

45:00.910 --> 45:04.990
<b>This ship has no propulsion...
20 trillion yen has disappeared.</b>

45:05.330 --> 45:07.620
<b>So, someone carried it here,</b>

45:07.750 --> 45:09.920
<b>and they took the money too?</b>

45:10.040 --> 45:12.000
<b>We were too late...</b>

45:12.130 --> 45:14.840
<b>Can ya really transport a ship this big?</b>

45:14.960 --> 45:18.130
<b>But it's right here, at the bottom of the Mariana Trench.</b>

45:18.260 --> 45:21.470
<b>Help meee!</b>

45:29.770 --> 45:30.770
<b>What the?!</b>

45:30.900 --> 45:32.520
<b>What, is it an earthquake?!</b>

45:45.990 --> 45:47.370
<b>What happened?</b>

45:48.500 --> 45:50.160
<b>The mast is broken!</b>

45:50.290 --> 45:51.330
<b>Where's Nobita-san?!</b>

45:51.830 --> 45:55.090
<b>- Nobita-kuuun!
- Hey, Nobitaaa!</b>

45:55.210 --> 45:56.800
<b>Over here!</b>

45:57.920 --> 46:00.300
<b>Nobita-kun!</b>

46:01.130 --> 46:02.970
<b>Here!</b>

46:03.590 --> 46:06.100
<b>- Are you alright, Nobita-kun?
- Yeah.</b>

46:06.220 --> 46:08.810
<b>Why're ya buried in a place like this?</b>

46:08.930 --> 46:10.890
<b>I was attacked by a huge fish!</b>

46:11.020 --> 46:13.150
<b>Did the fish destroy the boat?</b>

46:13.270 --> 46:14.360
<b>Yeah, it did!</b>

46:14.480 --> 46:17.570
<b>- A whale?
- Are there any this deep?</b>

46:17.780 --> 46:18.990
<b>It's true!</b>

46:19.110 --> 46:21.990
<b>There was a fish thiiis big!</b>

46:22.110 --> 46:23.910
<b>Yer still on that?</b>

46:24.030 --> 46:26.990
<b>Didn't ya say ya saw a huge squid yesterday too?</b>

46:27.120 --> 46:29.950
<b>But I did see it!
Buggy, you saw it too, right?</b>

46:30.080 --> 46:33.870
<b>I have not seen anything that
could be described as a fish.</b>

46:34.000 --> 46:34.920
<b>- Just...
- Oh come on...</b>

46:35.040 --> 46:37.550
<b>I guess Nobita was just mistaken after all.</b>

46:37.670 --> 46:40.170
<b>The ship looked pretty damaged too, so...</b>

46:41.300 --> 46:42.630
<b>But, it's true!</b>

46:42.760 --> 46:45.050
<b>There was a massive fish!</b>

46:45.180 --> 46:47.310
<b>Yeah, yeah. We get it, we get it.</b>

46:52.060 --> 46:54.520
<b>Still, it's all so strange.</b>

46:54.650 --> 46:58.150
<b>Hmm... there's no treasure, and
the ship's been moved.</b>

46:58.270 --> 47:00.900
<b>We found metal that was 7,000 years old.</b>

47:01.030 --> 47:03.700
<b>And a huge squid and a huge fish.</b>

47:03.820 --> 47:05.410
<b>And the strangest of all...</b>

47:05.530 --> 47:07.990
<b>The Adapting Light on Gian and Suneo.</b>

47:08.120 --> 47:10.450
<b>It definitely should've worn off by then.</b>

47:10.660 --> 47:14.000
<b>Yeah, I'm curious...</b>

47:26.300 --> 47:27.470
<b>Who is it?</b>

47:32.480 --> 47:34.190
<b>Buggy-chan.</b>

47:35.100 --> 47:36.650
<b>What happened?</b>

47:37.230 --> 47:39.610
<b>Do you have some time?</b>

47:40.480 --> 47:42.740
<b>Shizuka-san, you want to know about the</b>

47:42.860 --> 47:45.570
<b>Adapting Light incident with Gian and Suneo, right?</b>

47:45.700 --> 47:46.950
<b>Yeah.</b>

47:47.070 --> 47:50.740
<b>I saw it.
It is recorded in my memory.</b>

47:50.870 --> 47:51.910
<b>Do you want to see it?</b>

47:52.040 --> 47:53.750
<b>Huh? I can?!</b>

47:54.250 --> 47:55.500
<b>Yes.</b>

47:57.420 --> 47:59.290
<b>I will project the image.</b>

48:01.550 --> 48:04.380
<b><i>Are you going to die?
Humans are arrogant, but...</i></b>

48:04.510 --> 48:05.510
<b><i>In that case...</i></b>

48:05.630 --> 48:07.640
<b>You were just watching quietly?!</b>

48:07.930 --> 48:10.600
<b>There was no optimal solution.</b>

48:10.810 --> 48:12.810
<b>I ran a simulation, but</b>

48:12.930 --> 48:16.100
<b>death was an unavoidable outcome.</b>

48:16.520 --> 48:18.480
<b>What's going on, Shizuka-chan?</b>

48:18.600 --> 48:19.730
<b>Nobita-san.</b>

48:19.860 --> 48:22.480
<b>Ain't that us?</b>

48:22.610 --> 48:24.740
<b>Is it from that incident?</b>

48:24.860 --> 48:27.110
<b>I will increase the projection size.</b>

48:31.410 --> 48:33.240
<b>- Woah!
- What's that?!</b>

48:33.370 --> 48:34.700
<b>I do not know.</b>

48:34.830 --> 48:38.370
<b>I have all sorts of information
about the ocean.</b>

48:38.500 --> 48:39.750
<b>But there is no data on this.</b>

48:39.880 --> 48:41.750
<b>A person?!</b>

48:47.260 --> 48:49.050
<b>The Adapting Light?!</b>

48:50.930 --> 48:53.640
<b>That's it! It's the big fish I saw!</b>

48:54.010 --> 48:55.140
<b>See? I told you!</b>

48:55.270 --> 48:57.980
<b>We'll see that huge squid soon!</b>

48:58.100 --> 48:59.600
<b>It's not a fish!</b>

48:59.730 --> 49:02.440
<b>Fish can't shoot laser beams!</b>

49:09.410 --> 49:12.120
<b>After that, I froze.</b>

49:12.240 --> 49:14.580
<b>Why were ya holdin' onto somethin' that important...?!</b>

49:14.700 --> 49:16.250
<b>Stop that, Takeshi-san!</b>

49:16.370 --> 49:17.790
<b>Because I wasn't asked.</b>

49:17.910 --> 49:20.170
<b>Quit screwin' with me!</b>

49:20.290 --> 49:22.080
<b>Calm down, Gian!</b>

49:22.210 --> 49:23.750
<b>This isn't the time for fighting!</b>

49:23.880 --> 49:25.340
<b>Now, we have a new problem!</b>

49:25.840 --> 49:28.550
<b>Who exactly saved you two?!</b>

49:28.670 --> 49:30.800
<b>And why did they save you?!</b>

49:31.300 --> 49:33.220
<b>There being others besides us on sea floor,</b>

49:33.350 --> 49:36.270
<b>there's no doubt about it now.</b>

49:39.980 --> 49:41.770
<b>Stop that, Gian.</b>

49:43.310 --> 49:46.190
<b>N-N-N... Nobita-kun... slowly come over here.</b>

49:48.320 --> 49:51.820
<b>Uwaaah! A squid!</b>

49:53.120 --> 49:54.830
<b>Ah... see, I told you! I told you!</b>

49:54.950 --> 49:56.330
<b>This isn't the time to celebrate!</b>

50:02.540 --> 50:04.540
<b>Woah! Doraemon, pull something out!</b>

50:04.670 --> 50:06.210
<b>Something... something...</b>

50:06.340 --> 50:07.630
<b>Anywhere Door!</b>

50:11.800 --> 50:14.680
<b>Ah, no way!</b>

50:14.800 --> 50:17.640
<b>I'm not tasty! I'm not tasty!</b>

50:15.620 --> 50:17.640
<b>- Nobita!
- Nobita-san!</b>

50:17.770 --> 50:19.270
<b>Let go of Nobita-kun!</b>

50:20.480 --> 50:22.100
<b>Shizuka-chaaan!</b>

50:22.230 --> 50:23.850
<b>Small Light!</b>

50:26.320 --> 50:28.190
<b>Let go! You...</b>

50:29.650 --> 50:31.320
<b>Mommyyy!</b>

50:31.860 --> 50:33.860
<b>Dammit!</b>

50:48.840 --> 50:50.340
<b>Doraemon, what did you do?</b>

50:50.460 --> 50:52.340
<b>No, it wasn't me.</b>

50:53.720 --> 50:56.510
<b>- That's...
- It's the one from before...</b>

50:56.970 --> 51:00.100
<b>Did they help us again?</b>

51:00.720 --> 51:04.480
<b>Ah, thanks!
That was a close call again...</b>

51:25.370 --> 51:26.460
<b>This is...?!</b>

51:27.080 --> 51:30.130
<b>This is where you were born.</b>

51:30.250 --> 51:32.340
<b>3.8 billion years ago,</b>

51:32.460 --> 51:36.430
<b>the place where life first originated in the world...</b>

51:36.720 --> 51:38.850
<b>was in the depths of the sea.</b>

51:38.970 --> 51:42.770
<b>Eventually, they began living on land.</b>

51:42.890 --> 51:45.310
<b>This was only 400 million years ago.</b>

51:45.440 --> 51:48.400
<b>The fierce struggle for survival repeated.</b>

51:48.520 --> 51:53.110
<b>Many kinds of species were born and went extinct.</b>

51:53.240 --> 51:57.320
<b>Among them, some returned
from the land to the sea.</b>

51:59.700 --> 52:01.700
<b>For example, whales,</b>

52:02.870 --> 52:05.620
<b>dolphins, and seals.</b>

52:10.040 --> 52:11.630
<b>And then...</b>

52:13.050 --> 52:15.590
<b>We Undersea Dwellers.</b>

52:16.680 --> 52:18.300
<b>Undersea Dwellers?</b>

52:23.430 --> 52:24.930
<b>Doraemon!</b>

52:25.230 --> 52:26.600
<b>Shizuka-chan!</b>

52:26.730 --> 52:28.230
<b>Where are we?</b>

52:28.560 --> 52:29.980
<b>I don't know.</b>

52:30.270 --> 52:31.940
<b>I saw a weird dream.</b>

52:32.070 --> 52:33.190
<b>Me too!</b>

52:34.280 --> 52:36.650
<b>It was an educational dream.</b>

52:40.080 --> 52:41.080
<b>You're...</b>

52:42.080 --> 52:44.040
<b>To help people learn about us,</b>

52:45.200 --> 52:47.000
<b>the Undersea Dwellers.</b>

52:47.710 --> 52:49.460
<b>Then, it really was...!</b>

52:49.790 --> 52:50.790
<b>My apologies.</b>

52:52.420 --> 52:55.760
<b>I wasn't sure if I could trust you guys.</b>

52:55.880 --> 52:58.380
<b>That was way too violent!</b>

52:58.840 --> 53:01.760
<b>Violent? Surface Dwellers like
you have no right to say that.</b>

53:02.010 --> 53:03.010
<b>Huh?!</b>

53:03.140 --> 53:04.810
<b>We have witnessed the bloody,</b>

53:04.930 --> 53:08.020
<b>war-filled history of the Surface Dwellers.</b>

53:08.890 --> 53:10.480
<b>Being cautious is only natural.</b>

53:12.230 --> 53:16.990
<b>But, after examining your brainwaves,
we have determined that you pose no danger.</b>

53:17.110 --> 53:19.360
<b>We have decided to welcome you to our country.</b>

53:20.660 --> 53:21.660
<b>I am El.</b>

53:21.780 --> 53:23.370
<b>What do you mean?</b>

53:23.490 --> 53:26.660
<b>Nobita, Shizuka, and Doraemon, right?</b>

53:26.910 --> 53:29.000
<b>Still, this is troublesome.</b>

53:29.120 --> 53:31.330
<b>I can't believe you're a robot...</b>

53:31.460 --> 53:33.130
<b>You look like a dumbo octopus...</b>

53:34.210 --> 53:36.260
<b>A dumbo octopus?</b>

53:36.510 --> 53:38.090
<b>Absolutely not!</b>

53:38.420 --> 53:41.050
<b>I'm a cat-type robot!</b>

53:42.180 --> 53:45.010
<b>It'd be better to keep that a secret for now.</b>

53:45.390 --> 53:46.890
<b>Huh? Why?</b>

53:47.020 --> 53:49.690
<b>Also, where's Gian and Suneo?</b>

53:49.810 --> 53:50.980
<b>And Buggy-chan too!</b>

53:57.400 --> 54:01.660
<b>He was overheating. We are doing maintenance on him.</b>

54:01.780 --> 54:03.370
<b>Where are the other two?</b>

54:03.620 --> 54:05.160
<b>A psychiatric evaluation</b>

54:05.280 --> 54:09.290
<b>diagnosed them as 'violent' and 'deceitful',
so they are being held in custody.</b>

54:09.410 --> 54:11.120
<b>- Huh?!
- That's...!</b>

54:11.250 --> 54:13.790
<b>- There must be a misunderstanding!
- They're good guys at heart!</b>

54:14.460 --> 54:15.630
<b>Good guys?</b>

54:16.040 --> 54:18.210
<b>Let us talk to them!</b>

54:18.420 --> 54:21.180
<b>Hmm... follow me.</b>

54:28.520 --> 54:30.890
<b>- Amazing!
- It's pretty!</b>

54:31.730 --> 54:35.360
<b>A civilization like this exists on the sea floor...</b>

54:35.770 --> 54:37.780
<b>This is the Mu Federation.</b>

54:37.900 --> 54:40.570
<b>It's a short distance from the location of the sailing ship</b>

54:40.690 --> 54:42.110
<b>you were investigating.</b>

54:42.240 --> 54:43.780
<b>How did you...?</b>

54:44.070 --> 54:45.910
<b>I've been keeping an eye on you all</b>

54:46.030 --> 54:48.160
<b>since I found those two.</b>

54:48.290 --> 54:49.290
<b>That's it!</b>

54:49.370 --> 54:51.540
<b>When Gian and Suneo's Adapting Light wore off,</b>

54:51.660 --> 54:53.500
<b>you helped them didn't you, El?</b>

54:53.750 --> 54:56.880
<b>Ah, we call ours the Adap Light though...</b>

54:57.000 --> 54:58.840
<b>Why did you help us?</b>

55:04.430 --> 55:07.810
<b>How dare they shove people in a place like this?!</b>

55:08.430 --> 55:10.600
<b>Let us out!
If ya don't...!</b>

55:10.930 --> 55:14.230
<b>I'll smash and burn it all down...</b>

55:14.350 --> 55:17.360
<b>We're underwater, that won't work!</b>

55:19.940 --> 55:21.690
<b>These are those 'good guys'?</b>

55:21.820 --> 55:23.280
<b>This is bad...</b>

55:23.650 --> 55:25.360
<b>Oh, everyone!</b>

55:25.490 --> 55:27.240
<b>Get us out of here!</b>

55:27.700 --> 55:31.830
<b>I'll find a way to get you out!
Just wait a little more!</b>

55:32.080 --> 55:34.790
<b>Oh! My friend of the heart!</b>

55:35.420 --> 55:38.750
<b>In any case, I can't decide this on my own.</b>

55:39.340 --> 55:42.210
<b>You should try talking to
the Prime Minister directly.</b>

55:46.220 --> 55:47.340
<b>Absolutely not!</b>

55:47.470 --> 55:50.850
<b>They are far too dangerous!
Absolutely not!</b>

55:51.220 --> 55:54.770
<b>Simply being a Surface Dweller
makes you an unwelcome guest.</b>

55:54.890 --> 55:56.730
<b>However, as per the laws of the sea floor,</b>

55:56.850 --> 56:00.480
<b>defenseless intelligent lifeforms
are eligible for protection.</b>

56:00.610 --> 56:04.150
<b>Those of you who pass the screening
will be bestowed citizenship.</b>

56:04.570 --> 56:07.610
<b>You will spend your entire lives here.</b>

56:07.820 --> 56:08.950
<b>Huh?!</b>

56:09.070 --> 56:11.080
<b>You dragged us here by force!</b>

56:11.410 --> 56:15.500
<b>We can't let the Surface Dwellers
find out about this place.</b>

56:15.710 --> 56:17.330
<b>We won't speak of this to anyone!</b>

56:17.460 --> 56:18.960
<b>So let us go home!</b>

56:19.330 --> 56:23.420
<b>That's not allowed. According to the law, anyone who crosses the border without permission...</b>

56:24.090 --> 56:25.880
<b>...is sentenced to death.</b>

56:30.260 --> 56:34.520
<b>Don't worry, we won't harm you.
You'll get used to it quickly.</b>

56:35.230 --> 56:38.480
<b>- Wait a second!
- Ah, Nobita-kun!</b>

56:42.820 --> 56:45.440
<b>Feel free to use this space however you like.</b>

56:45.570 --> 56:48.700
<b>However, please refrain from
going outside for the time being.</b>

56:49.200 --> 56:51.370
<b>If anything happens, tell the people outside.</b>

56:51.490 --> 56:52.660
<b>Bye then.</b>

57:00.920 --> 57:02.710
<b>Ah... this is the worst!</b>

57:02.840 --> 57:05.670
<b>Forget summer vacation, we're
stuck here for the rest of our lives!</b>

57:05.800 --> 57:09.050
<b>That's not gonna happen.
Let's get outta here quickly!</b>

57:10.140 --> 57:12.600
<b>- But, if we get caught?
- The death penalty!</b>

57:12.720 --> 57:14.260
<b>That's way too dangerous!</b>

57:14.390 --> 57:16.930
<b>Then, we just need to not get caught.</b>

57:17.060 --> 57:19.600
<b>Who do you think I am?</b>

57:19.730 --> 57:21.560
<b>Doraemon!</b>

57:23.440 --> 57:25.940
<b>Just follow orders!</b>

57:26.070 --> 57:29.200
<b>It's about time we replaced it with a new one.</b>

57:37.910 --> 57:39.000
<b>Buggy-chan?</b>

57:39.580 --> 57:41.960
<b>Sh... Shizuka-san?</b>

57:42.500 --> 57:44.920
<b>Buggy, Shizuka-chan!
Hurry!</b>

57:47.590 --> 57:50.510
<b>It's no good, it won't budge.</b>

57:55.760 --> 57:58.270
<b>My friends of the heart!
Ya kept us waitin'!</b>

57:58.390 --> 58:00.270
<b>Get off me already!</b>

58:01.190 --> 58:03.860
<b>The Prime Minister, was he angry?</b>

58:03.980 --> 58:07.230
<b>Why did you help them?
You could've just ignored it.</b>

58:07.990 --> 58:10.240
<b>I don't know myself.</b>

58:10.570 --> 58:12.200
<b>I just thought it was right.</b>

58:12.610 --> 58:14.200
<b>I hope their arrival</b>

58:14.320 --> 58:16.620
<b>doesn't provoke Poseidon...</b>

58:19.000 --> 58:20.870
<b>- Come right away!
- What happened?</b>

58:21.000 --> 58:23.040
<b>The Surface Dwellers have escaped!</b>

58:23.170 --> 58:25.540
<b>- Huh?!
- What did you say?!</b>

58:32.630 --> 58:35.470
<b>They've already noticed.
Getting ahead of them will be dangerous.</b>

58:36.220 --> 58:37.470
<b>Now!</b>

58:45.690 --> 58:47.690
<b>We've already been separated...</b>

58:48.690 --> 58:50.400
<b>- Ah.
- Hm? What?</b>

58:50.530 --> 58:52.070
<b>- Quiet.
- Hey, you!</b>

58:52.320 --> 58:54.280
<b>Wah, we've been spotted!</b>

58:54.870 --> 58:55.990
<b>Hold on!</b>

59:00.950 --> 59:03.120
<b>- Uwah, sorry!
- Stop!</b>

59:11.340 --> 59:13.050
<b>Where did they go?!</b>

59:13.180 --> 59:15.340
<b>- This way!
- Huh?</b>

59:17.390 --> 59:19.890
<b>They must still be nearby!</b>

59:24.060 --> 59:25.520
<b>Thank goodness you're safe.</b>

59:25.650 --> 59:27.400
<b>Seriously, where did you go?</b>

59:27.520 --> 59:29.230
<b>Don't make us worry!</b>

59:29.360 --> 59:30.940
<b>Sorry...</b>

59:31.420 --> 59:34.420
<b>- Have you seen any Surface Dwellers?
- I haven't.</b>

59:31.490 --> 59:34.110
<b>Let's go around from that side.</b>

59:36.320 --> 59:38.490
<b>Ugh! Here too...</b>

59:40.450 --> 59:42.830
<b>Are you all Surface Dwellers?</b>

59:44.410 --> 59:46.630
<b>N-No we're not!</b>

59:48.840 --> 59:50.340
<b>Stop!</b>

59:51.380 --> 59:53.010
<b>We're looking for Surface Dwellers!</b>

59:53.630 --> 59:55.430
<b>Have you seen them around here?</b>

59:55.630 --> 59:57.220
<b>Surface-Dwellers?</b>

59:57.340 --> 59:59.390
<b>Ah, I have!</b>

59:59.510 --> 01:00:00.810
<b>- Heheheh.
- Really?!</b>

01:00:00.930 --> 01:00:02.600
<b>Hold on! This old lady</b>

01:00:02.720 --> 01:00:05.140
<b>had lied and said she went to Atlantis.</b>

01:00:05.270 --> 01:00:07.400
<b>Come on, stop messing with us!</b>

01:00:07.690 --> 01:00:10.690
<b>That's enough! Go!</b>

01:00:11.230 --> 01:00:12.570
<b>Stop!</b>

01:00:14.110 --> 01:00:16.240
<b>Stay hidden.</b>

01:00:16.360 --> 01:00:19.700
<b>I'll take you close to the border.</b>

01:00:20.740 --> 01:00:23.370
<b>Hey, are we going to be fine with her?</b>

01:00:23.500 --> 01:00:24.910
<b>I'm not sure, but...</b>

01:00:25.040 --> 01:00:28.330
<b>It seems safer than just running away.</b>

01:00:36.720 --> 01:00:38.720
<b>We've arrived.</b>

01:00:42.220 --> 01:00:46.810
<b>If you go straight through this
oyster field, you'll reach the border.</b>

01:00:46.940 --> 01:00:50.440
<b>Once you've crossed the border,
security should be fairly lax.</b>

01:00:50.560 --> 01:00:53.020
<b>Ah... hey, Nobita!</b>

01:00:53.150 --> 01:00:54.440
<b>Let's go!</b>

01:00:54.650 --> 01:00:56.820
<b>Why did you help us?</b>

01:00:56.950 --> 01:00:59.990
<b>It seems like everyone hates us
Surface Dwellers down here.</b>

01:01:00.120 --> 01:01:03.200
<b>There's bound to be someone
who thinks differently, right?</b>

01:01:03.330 --> 01:01:07.370
<b>Don't take it personally; everyone's just scared.</b>

01:01:08.040 --> 01:01:11.840
<b>They don't want to make a
certain someone angry, you see?</b>

01:01:12.290 --> 01:01:15.920
<b>Hurry up, and don't get caught!</b>

01:01:20.010 --> 01:01:21.510
<b>Hurry!</b>

01:01:26.060 --> 01:01:27.890
<b>Nobita-kun, hurry!</b>

01:01:28.020 --> 01:01:29.440
<b>Yeah.</b>

01:01:46.950 --> 01:01:48.500
<b>What a stupid thing to do!</b>

01:01:50.870 --> 01:01:51.920
<b>They're here!</b>

01:01:56.090 --> 01:01:57.880
<b>What do we do, Doraemon?!</b>

01:01:58.260 --> 01:02:01.840
<b>That's the border, right?
There's nowhere to hide!</b>

01:02:02.050 --> 01:02:05.310
<b>Time for the Chameleon Cap to shine!</b>

01:02:10.640 --> 01:02:12.480
<b>El! That's...?!</b>

01:02:13.100 --> 01:02:14.650
<b>Found them!</b>

01:02:14.770 --> 01:02:16.610
<b>Hurry! Hurry!</b>

01:02:18.240 --> 01:02:20.570
<b>You guys! Surrender now!</b>

01:02:20.700 --> 01:02:22.570
<b>El...</b>

01:02:22.740 --> 01:02:24.200
<b>Hurry!</b>

01:02:30.500 --> 01:02:32.000
<b>- They disappeared?!
- Huh?</b>

01:02:34.380 --> 01:02:36.380
<b>Hey, what's going on?</b>

01:02:36.500 --> 01:02:39.130
<b>We're in a hyperspace pocket
under the surface.</b>

01:02:39.260 --> 01:02:41.720
<b>To El and the others, it looks
just like the Earth's surface.</b>

01:02:42.130 --> 01:02:44.970
<b>Well, it's kinda like a one-way mirror.</b>

01:02:45.100 --> 01:02:46.640
<b>Look, they're gone.</b>

01:02:47.140 --> 01:02:49.770
<b>Even if they disappear, we know where they're headed!</b>

01:02:53.100 --> 01:02:54.400
<b>Come, let's go!</b>

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:58.190
<b>As we move forward, the hyperspace
moves along with us.</b>

01:03:03.030 --> 01:03:05.030
<b>Let's cross the border!</b>

01:03:13.620 --> 01:03:18.000
<b>If they cross the border, there's
no escaping the death penalty.</b>

01:03:23.510 --> 01:03:25.720
<b>The ocean trench ends here.</b>

01:03:25.840 --> 01:03:28.810
<b>The Chameleon Cap can't move vertically.</b>

01:03:28.930 --> 01:03:30.270
<b>What do we do?</b>

01:03:30.390 --> 01:03:32.480
<b>We have no choice but to wait
for El and the others to leave.</b>

01:03:32.600 --> 01:03:34.890
<b>Hey, look! That's what attacked me!</b>

01:03:43.190 --> 01:03:45.030
<b>We've lost control!</b>

01:03:52.580 --> 01:03:54.460
<b>El is...!</b>

01:03:54.620 --> 01:03:56.000
<b>Please respond!</b>

01:03:56.120 --> 01:03:59.420
<b>We were attacked by a Battlefish!
We're unable to fight back!</b>

01:03:59.880 --> 01:04:01.550
<b>It looks like they can't move...</b>

01:04:01.670 --> 01:04:02.880
<b>It's coming back!</b>

01:04:06.050 --> 01:04:07.840
<b>Hold on, Gian!</b>

01:04:08.090 --> 01:04:10.600
<b>I can't stand by and watch!</b>

01:04:10.720 --> 01:04:12.390
<b>I'm helping them now!</b>

01:04:13.680 --> 01:04:16.270
<b>Come at me!
I'm yer opponent!</b>

01:04:18.480 --> 01:04:19.860
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

01:04:20.190 --> 01:04:22.570
<b>- Us too!
- Yeah!</b>

01:04:22.690 --> 01:04:23.900
<b>Geez!</b>

01:04:24.030 --> 01:04:27.820
<b>Geez, I'm going too! Mommy!</b>

01:04:33.080 --> 01:04:34.950
<b>It's useless! Run!</b>

01:04:38.630 --> 01:04:40.710
<b>I'll catch ya!</b>

01:04:40.840 --> 01:04:43.340
<b>- Doraemooon!
- Calm down!</b>

01:04:43.590 --> 01:04:45.470
<b>Small Light!</b>

01:04:45.590 --> 01:04:47.970
<b>Got it on the first try!
Take this!</b>

01:04:56.890 --> 01:04:59.150
<b>Gotcha!</b>

01:05:00.520 --> 01:05:02.770
<b>Geez! Get it away from me!</b>

01:05:05.820 --> 01:05:07.900
<b>We did it!</b>

01:05:12.740 --> 01:05:15.120
<b>Oh, yer safe!</b>

01:05:15.540 --> 01:05:17.040
<b>Why did you come out?!</b>

01:05:18.420 --> 01:05:22.250
<b>I'm... here to catch you guys!</b>

01:05:22.380 --> 01:05:25.960
<b>Those who cross the border will
be sentenced to death...</b>

01:05:26.090 --> 01:05:28.010
<b>So why did you come out?!</b>

01:05:28.130 --> 01:05:31.220
<b>Now, there's no way I can...</b>

01:05:31.850 --> 01:05:34.640
<b>Surface Dwellers!
Hands in the air!</b>

01:05:35.390 --> 01:05:38.640
<b>You are completely surrounded!</b>

01:05:38.850 --> 01:05:40.060
<b>Yeah, they're up!</b>

01:05:49.110 --> 01:05:51.990
<b>Can there be anythin'
more stupid than this?!</b>

01:05:52.120 --> 01:05:55.490
<b>If we had just hidden, we coulda escaped!</b>

01:05:55.790 --> 01:05:58.960
<b>Who was the idiot that decided to jump out?!</b>

01:05:59.080 --> 01:06:00.420
<b>Ah, it was me...</b>

01:06:00.540 --> 01:06:02.420
<b>I'm an idiot! Idiot! Idiot!</b>

01:06:02.540 --> 01:06:05.380
<b>What's going to happen to us...?</b>

01:06:05.500 --> 01:06:08.550
<b>As El said, it's the death penalty, right?</b>

01:06:08.670 --> 01:06:09.920
<b>Mommy!</b>

01:06:11.090 --> 01:06:14.430
<b>Nobita, I have something that I want to ask you.</b>

01:06:14.640 --> 01:06:15.850
<b>At a time like this?</b>

01:06:15.970 --> 01:06:19.020
<b>Why are humans so irrational?</b>

01:06:19.140 --> 01:06:23.100
<b>I have been watching you all for the past
few days, and I can't understand it.</b>

01:06:23.690 --> 01:06:27.280
<b>If you hadn't come out earlier, then...</b>

01:06:27.400 --> 01:06:29.650
<b>That's complicated.</b>

01:06:29.780 --> 01:06:31.500
<b>Back then...</b>

01:06:32.070 --> 01:06:36.160
<b>Even though I knew better, I
didn't make the 'correct' choice.</b>

01:06:36.280 --> 01:06:38.180
<b>I just did what I thought was 'right'.</b>

01:06:39.500 --> 01:06:42.500
<b>Is there a difference between 'right' and 'correct'?</b>

01:06:45.590 --> 01:06:48.140
<b>There are times when there isn't.</b>

01:06:48.840 --> 01:06:51.180
<b>What your heart thinks is right...</b>

01:06:52.760 --> 01:06:56.520
<b>Isn't 'heart' your internal organ...?</b>

01:06:57.560 --> 01:07:00.480
<b>No... it's different.</b>

01:07:01.100 --> 01:07:03.560
<b>I don't understand what a 'heart' is.</b>

01:07:05.060 --> 01:07:07.520
<b>'Right' and 'correct' aren't the same thing...</b>

01:07:08.270 --> 01:07:09.840
<b>It's like...</b>

01:07:11.570 --> 01:07:13.130
<b>a 'bug', isn't it?</b>

01:07:13.610 --> 01:07:17.240
<b>We humans are complicated, aren't we?</b>

01:07:17.990 --> 01:07:21.960
<b>There are many things that I don't know either...</b>

01:07:24.790 --> 01:07:27.310
<b>The verdict regarding the five Surface Dwellers is that</b>

01:07:27.790 --> 01:07:31.670
<b>in accordance with the laws of the Mu Federation, they are to be sentenced to death.</b>

01:07:32.090 --> 01:07:34.840
<b>Are there any objections?</b>

01:07:35.720 --> 01:07:37.550
<b>And with that, parliament is adjourned...</b>

01:07:37.680 --> 01:07:39.100
<b>Wait a moment!</b>

01:07:40.390 --> 01:07:41.560
<b>What?</b>

01:07:43.560 --> 01:07:45.520
<b>No, it's just...</b>

01:07:45.900 --> 01:07:47.860
<b>Please grant them amnesty...</b>

01:07:49.110 --> 01:07:51.480
<b>They helped me without
regard for their own safety.</b>

01:07:52.360 --> 01:07:53.900
<b>They are heroes!</b>

01:07:54.030 --> 01:07:57.160
<b>Heroes? They're just naive...</b>

01:07:57.280 --> 01:07:58.740
<b>Realizing they couldn't escape,</b>

01:07:58.870 --> 01:08:01.410
<b>they probably thought they could
save you to gain your sympathy.</b>

01:08:01.870 --> 01:08:04.370
<b>Is that the only way you can interpret it?</b>

01:08:05.000 --> 01:08:08.130
<b>They couldn't just leave someone to die,</b>

01:08:08.250 --> 01:08:10.060
<b>that could've been the reason they had...</b>

01:08:10.800 --> 01:08:14.440
<b>It makes me ashamed to be a Undersea Dweller!</b>

01:08:15.010 --> 01:08:18.090
<b>We can acknowledge their heroic actions.</b>

01:08:18.220 --> 01:08:20.010
<b>However, rules are rules.</b>

01:08:20.140 --> 01:08:23.730
<b>According to Mu's criminal code,
crossing the border is punishable by death.</b>

01:08:23.850 --> 01:08:27.060
<b>That's ridiculous! It's a thousand-year-old law</b>

01:08:27.190 --> 01:08:28.730
<b>that's smeared with oyster shells!</b>

01:08:30.650 --> 01:08:32.030
<b>I understand.</b>

01:08:32.150 --> 01:08:35.360
<b>These laws were created out of fear of Poseidon.</b>

01:08:35.490 --> 01:08:38.410
<b>These laws were made to minimize the impact</b>

01:08:38.530 --> 01:08:40.740
<b>of crossing the border, and of technology.</b>

01:08:40.870 --> 01:08:42.160
<b>What are you trying to say?</b>

01:08:42.910 --> 01:08:45.120
<b>It's my heart!
What's important is...</b>

01:08:45.710 --> 01:08:49.400
<b>that at first, I didn't understand why I helped them.</b>

01:08:50.040 --> 01:08:52.290
<b>But, when I looked at them, I realized.</b>

01:08:52.880 --> 01:08:54.920
<b>I have a heart too!</b>

01:08:55.050 --> 01:08:56.550
<b>A human heart!</b>

01:08:56.670 --> 01:08:58.430
<b>Please calm down.</b>

01:08:58.550 --> 01:09:01.510
<b>Have you forgotten what the Surface Dwellers have done?!</b>

01:09:01.640 --> 01:09:04.430
<b>They pollute the ocean with sewage and plastic.</b>

01:09:04.560 --> 01:09:06.810
<b>They mine for resources in the deep sea.</b>

01:09:06.930 --> 01:09:09.230
<b>There's no room for sympathy for them!</b>

01:09:09.350 --> 01:09:10.980
<b>Don'tcha think so?!</b>

01:09:11.110 --> 01:09:13.480
<b>That's right!</b>

01:09:15.530 --> 01:09:17.700
<b>Isn't this exactly the same as 50 years ago?!</b>

01:09:19.110 --> 01:09:20.860
<b>Then, what about us?</b>

01:09:21.450 --> 01:09:25.870
<b>We brush our fears under the rug, and refuse to confront the root of the problem!</b>

01:09:26.000 --> 01:09:27.780
<b>We've come to view change as a negative thing!</b>

01:09:28.670 --> 01:09:32.540
<b>If we'd listened to her, and trusted her without hesitation...</b>

01:09:33.210 --> 01:09:37.130
<b>Perhaps, a different future awaited us!</b>

01:09:37.260 --> 01:09:39.090
<b>Watch your mouth!</b>

01:09:42.010 --> 01:09:43.260
<b>What happened?</b>

01:09:43.390 --> 01:09:44.560
<b>I've a report!</b>

01:09:45.180 --> 01:09:49.480
<b>The Bermuda Volcanic Zone Observatory
has issued a Level 5 activity alert!</b>

01:09:50.770 --> 01:09:53.340
<b>The Devil's Castle has become operational!</b>

01:09:55.320 --> 01:09:57.200
<b>We're displaying footage from the observatory!</b>

01:10:02.160 --> 01:10:05.870
<b>This is the worst possible scenario.</b>

01:10:06.740 --> 01:10:08.200
<b>The world is...</b>

01:10:08.830 --> 01:10:09.790
<b>going to end.</b>

01:10:09.910 --> 01:10:12.290
<b>It's a Level 5! Hurry!</b>

01:10:12.710 --> 01:10:15.210
<b>Did something happen?</b>

01:10:17.590 --> 01:10:18.840
<b>Oh, God.</b>

01:10:18.970 --> 01:10:22.800
<b>Oh God of Navarre, ruler of the four seas.</b>

01:10:22.930 --> 01:10:26.310
<b>Please stop the activity of the underwater volcano.</b>

01:10:26.720 --> 01:10:28.390
<b>We no longer</b>

01:10:28.520 --> 01:10:31.270
<b>have a way to stop it.</b>

01:10:32.730 --> 01:10:35.730
<b>There is only one way.</b>

01:10:38.440 --> 01:10:39.780
<b>Allow me to introduce you.</b>

01:10:39.900 --> 01:10:41.860
<b>50 years ago,</b>

01:10:41.990 --> 01:10:45.160
<b>Miss Triline, reported contact with Poseidon.</b>

01:10:46.410 --> 01:10:48.620
<b>What does she have to do with this?</b>

01:10:49.080 --> 01:10:53.620
<b>She may be the only one who has
returned alive from the Devil's Castle.</b>

01:10:53.750 --> 01:10:55.590
<b>Let's hear her story again.</b>

01:10:56.090 --> 01:10:58.170
<b>There was no evidence at the time.</b>

01:10:58.300 --> 01:11:00.170
<b>Are you telling us to trust her?</b>

01:11:00.300 --> 01:11:01.970
<b>It's too dangerous.</b>

01:11:02.090 --> 01:11:04.640
<b>Has anyone else seen Poseidon?</b>

01:11:04.760 --> 01:11:06.510
<b>Or visited Atlantis?</b>

01:11:10.850 --> 01:11:12.770
<b>What we should do now is</b>

01:11:12.890 --> 01:11:15.440
<b>not try and appease Poseidon.</b>

01:11:15.940 --> 01:11:18.900
<b>And definitely not just sit and pray!</b>

01:11:19.110 --> 01:11:22.030
<b>It's a long story, so let me sit down.</b>

01:11:22.150 --> 01:11:23.990
<b>My back hurts.</b>

01:11:24.110 --> 01:11:25.870
<b>Sorry, I didn't notice...</b>

01:11:27.240 --> 01:11:31.200
<b>If you don't make a choice,
and just stand here praying,</b>

01:11:31.330 --> 01:11:33.790
<b>we'll have no choice left but to
perish together with this country.</b>

01:11:34.290 --> 01:11:37.130
<b>But if this woman's story is true...</b>

01:11:37.250 --> 01:11:40.090
<b>We can stop Atlantis!</b>

01:11:40.210 --> 01:11:42.590
<b>If it's true, it's a sliver of hope!</b>

01:11:42.720 --> 01:11:44.720
<b>And if it's a lie, it's the end of the world.</b>

01:11:44.840 --> 01:11:46.720
<b>It's one of those two!</b>

01:11:46.840 --> 01:11:48.970
<b>Now is the time for change!</b>

01:11:49.100 --> 01:11:51.640
<b>Prime Minister! Follow your heart!</b>

01:11:51.770 --> 01:11:53.850
<b>Make the right choice!</b>

01:12:04.400 --> 01:12:05.780
<b>Please, lady.</b>

01:12:05.910 --> 01:12:09.780
<b>Could you please tell us about that time again?</b>

01:12:13.290 --> 01:12:15.210
<b>Of course, that's fine, but...</b>

01:12:15.330 --> 01:12:20.000
<b>Even if we could go to Atlantis,
they'd be just as powerful.</b>

01:12:20.130 --> 01:12:21.670
<b>Whether we win or not...</b>

01:12:22.260 --> 01:12:23.630
<b>I understand.</b>

01:12:24.380 --> 01:12:26.930
<b>Besides us, there are some others</b>

01:12:27.050 --> 01:12:31.060
<b>who hold the key to this future.</b>

01:12:35.980 --> 01:12:38.650
<b>Ahhh! I don't wanna die!</b>

01:12:38.770 --> 01:12:41.150
<b>Mommy!</b>

01:12:46.030 --> 01:12:49.570
<b>We have a favor to ask.
Would you be willing to help us?</b>

01:12:49.700 --> 01:12:52.080
<b>To save the world!</b>

01:12:52.200 --> 01:12:54.080
<b>We need your strength.</b>

01:12:55.160 --> 01:12:58.000
<b>Once more... help us!</b>

01:13:09.010 --> 01:13:11.300
<b>- Ah!
- Grandma!</b>

01:13:11.430 --> 01:13:14.060
<b>Did ya get caught cuz of us?</b>

01:13:14.180 --> 01:13:17.270
<b>Don't worry. I'm glad you all are safe.</b>

01:13:17.390 --> 01:13:19.350
<b>But, why are you here?</b>

01:13:19.480 --> 01:13:21.520
<b>This person is Miss Triline.</b>

01:13:21.650 --> 01:13:26.190
<b>She is an essential figure for this operation:
The capture of the Devil's Castle.</b>

01:13:26.320 --> 01:13:29.410
<b>- Devil's Castle?
- Operation?</b>

01:13:30.160 --> 01:13:31.160
<b>The Devil's Castle is</b>

01:13:31.280 --> 01:13:34.120
<b>a fortress ruled by an AI named Poseidon.</b>

01:13:34.240 --> 01:13:38.750
<b>Approximately 7,000 years ago, we,
the Mu Federation of the Pacific,</b>

01:13:38.870 --> 01:13:42.130
<b>were at war with the Atlantic
Federation of the Atlantic Ocean.</b>

01:13:42.340 --> 01:13:45.170
<b>I've heard it was a terrible war.</b>

01:13:45.300 --> 01:13:47.090
<b>Robos and Battlefish were used.</b>

01:13:47.420 --> 01:13:49.180
<b>7,000 years ago...</b>

01:13:52.260 --> 01:13:53.510
<b>Then this...</b>

01:13:53.890 --> 01:13:57.180
<b>How do you have that?
It belongs to our Mu Federation.</b>

01:13:57.310 --> 01:13:58.480
<b>Seriously?!</b>

01:13:58.600 --> 01:13:59.890
<b>So it's true...</b>

01:14:00.020 --> 01:14:01.650
<b>I told you so!</b>

01:14:01.770 --> 01:14:05.650
<b>During that time, Atlantis developed the Devil's Horns.</b>

01:14:05.940 --> 01:14:07.360
<b>The Devil's Horns?</b>

01:14:07.740 --> 01:14:10.030
<b>They are bombs powerful
enough to destroy the Earth.</b>

01:14:11.700 --> 01:14:15.990
<b>So, they used them to threaten the Mu Federation into unconditional surrender.</b>

01:14:16.240 --> 01:14:18.410
<b>But Mu still exists, doesn't it?</b>

01:14:18.540 --> 01:14:21.960
<b>- Ya idiot!
- Can't you tell just by looking?</b>

01:14:22.170 --> 01:14:26.880
<b>The experiment with the Devil's
Horns failed, and Atlantis fell.</b>

01:14:27.000 --> 01:14:30.380
<b>Hold on! Didn't you just say they
could destroy the Earth...?</b>

01:14:30.720 --> 01:14:33.930
<b>Atlantis had erected a barrier around themselves</b>

01:14:34.050 --> 01:14:36.310
<b>to remain protected from the Devil's Horns.</b>

01:14:36.430 --> 01:14:39.020
<b>This barrier stretches far into the heavens.</b>

01:14:39.140 --> 01:14:42.770
<b>In a cruel twist of irony, it served to
contain the explosion within Atlantis.</b>

01:14:42.900 --> 01:14:45.150
<b>It's the Bermuda Triangle!</b>

01:14:48.320 --> 01:14:49.610
<b>But that's strange.</b>

01:14:49.780 --> 01:14:52.320
<b>Doesn't that mean we should be at peace now?</b>

01:14:52.450 --> 01:14:55.570
<b>The AI Poseidon survived.</b>

01:14:55.700 --> 01:14:58.040
<b>If the territory of the Devil's Castle is disturbed,</b>

01:14:58.160 --> 01:15:01.580
<b>it is programmed to fire the remaining Devil's Horns.</b>

01:15:02.160 --> 01:15:05.710
<b>As long as we didn't bother it,
there wasn't any problem.</b>

01:15:05.840 --> 01:15:08.550
<b>That's why we, the Mu Federation,
continued to avoid it.</b>

01:15:08.800 --> 01:15:11.840
<b>But now, it is under threat.</b>

01:15:11.970 --> 01:15:15.760
<b>An underwater volcano is about
to erupt near the Devil's Castle.</b>

01:15:15.890 --> 01:15:19.720
<b>If it erupts, Poseidon may think
that it is under attack.</b>

01:15:20.180 --> 01:15:23.690
<b>It will fire the Devil's Horns deployed outside the barrier.</b>

01:15:24.230 --> 01:15:27.610
<b>Not even a single fish, insect, or blade of grass</b>

01:15:27.940 --> 01:15:29.570
<b>will remain alive.</b>

01:15:30.650 --> 01:15:32.030
<b>The Earth will...</b>

01:15:32.450 --> 01:15:34.450
<b>become a dead planet.</b>

01:15:34.570 --> 01:15:38.950
<b>That's why, we must stop Poseidon at all costs.</b>

01:15:39.660 --> 01:15:40.950
<b>But... how?</b>

01:15:41.080 --> 01:15:44.420
<b>Won't we have to sneak past the barrier and the Devil's Horns to reach Poseidon?</b>

01:15:44.540 --> 01:15:46.920
<b>That's where Miss Triline comes in.</b>

01:15:47.290 --> 01:15:50.000
<b>There's no one left who has met Poseidon.</b>

01:15:50.130 --> 01:15:51.840
<b>However, Miss Triline...</b>

01:15:51.960 --> 01:15:56.760
<b>50 years ago, she reported making
contact with Poseidon during a mission.</b>

01:15:57.050 --> 01:15:59.220
<b>However, the Parliament at the time decided that</b>

01:15:59.350 --> 01:16:02.600
<b>further investigation would only fuel public anxiety, and stopped pursuing the matter.</b>

01:16:02.730 --> 01:16:05.230
<b>Her statement was declared to be false.</b>

01:16:05.350 --> 01:16:08.110
<b>Man, I can't understand all these big words...</b>

01:16:09.480 --> 01:16:13.030
<b>In simple words, based on her report,
we're heading for Poseidon.</b>

01:16:13.150 --> 01:16:16.450
<b>Hmm... what did Grandma see at that time?</b>

01:16:16.570 --> 01:16:18.660
<b>It'd be nice if we could see it too.</b>

01:16:18.780 --> 01:16:20.790
<b>We can!</b>

01:16:21.180 --> 01:16:24.050
Image Light

01:16:24.210 --> 01:16:25.710
<b>What's that?</b>

01:16:25.830 --> 01:16:28.000
<b>This is a gadget that lets everyone see</b>

01:16:28.130 --> 01:16:30.500
<b>what's going on inside a person's mind.</b>

01:16:30.630 --> 01:16:31.960
<b>Is that possible?</b>

01:16:32.250 --> 01:16:35.930
<b>Grandma, please show us what happened that time.</b>

01:16:36.470 --> 01:16:38.510
<b>During my mission,</b>

01:16:38.640 --> 01:16:42.350
<b>I was attacked by a Battlefish, and crashed.</b>

01:16:42.640 --> 01:16:44.270
<b>Soon after,</b>

01:16:44.390 --> 01:16:48.270
<b>a robot soldier clad in metal armor arrived.</b>

01:16:50.820 --> 01:16:54.190
<b>I believe they were called the Iron Cavalry.</b>

01:16:54.320 --> 01:16:55.900
<b>They captured me...</b>

01:16:56.030 --> 01:16:58.660
<b>and took me to Poseidon.</b>

01:16:59.200 --> 01:17:03.120
<b>I thought I was going to die.</b>

01:17:04.370 --> 01:17:06.580
<b>So that's Poseidon...</b>

01:17:06.790 --> 01:17:10.040
<b>But, I managed to find an opportunity and escape.</b>

01:17:10.580 --> 01:17:14.260
<b>Passing through rock crevices and chimney caves,</b>

01:17:14.380 --> 01:17:17.720
<b>I finally managed to cross the barrier.</b>

01:17:17.840 --> 01:17:22.220
<b>Luckily, a search party from Mu found me soon after.</b>

01:17:22.350 --> 01:17:24.850
<b>They rescued me.</b>

01:17:26.480 --> 01:17:29.440
<b>It truly was a miracle that I was able to escape.</b>

01:17:30.100 --> 01:17:31.900
<b>Unbelievable...</b>

01:17:32.020 --> 01:17:33.400
<b>Miss Triline.</b>

01:17:33.650 --> 01:17:34.900
<b>This is rather belated but,</b>

01:17:35.030 --> 01:17:39.320
<b>I offer my sincerest apologies for all the rudeness
I displayed to you up until now.</b>

01:17:40.660 --> 01:17:43.830
<b>It's fine. Now go and save the world.</b>

01:17:44.080 --> 01:17:46.410
<b>Yes, we will!</b>

01:17:49.460 --> 01:17:52.960
<b>Team Abyss will take the lead and distract the Battlefish.</b>

01:17:52.960 --> 01:17:53.960
<b>Yes sir!</b>

01:17:54.090 --> 01:17:55.800
<b>And our Team Ventus will</b>

01:17:55.920 --> 01:17:58.760
<b>neutralize the Devil's Horns in
preparation for the eruption.</b>

01:17:58.880 --> 01:18:02.680
<b>And you all, together with El, must stop Poseidon.</b>

01:18:04.350 --> 01:18:07.640
<b>Well then, I wish you all the best!</b>

01:18:07.930 --> 01:18:10.390
<b>In the future where we've saved the world,</b>

01:18:10.640 --> 01:18:13.400
<b>we'll definitely meet again!</b>

01:18:15.230 --> 01:18:18.780
<b>We need to go faster, or we won't
make it before the eruption!</b>

01:18:18.900 --> 01:18:21.280
<b>That's insane! I'm carrying six people!</b>

01:18:21.410 --> 01:18:23.030
<b>Please, Buggy-chan!</b>

01:18:23.160 --> 01:18:25.200
<b>If we don't make it in time, it's pointless!</b>

01:18:25.330 --> 01:18:27.750
<b>The fate of the world rests on you, Buggy-chan!</b>

01:18:31.960 --> 01:18:34.210
<b>You selfish jerk!</b>

01:18:38.420 --> 01:18:40.170
<b>We're underwater.</b>

01:18:40.300 --> 01:18:42.180
<b>The dirt will come off without scrubbing.</b>

01:18:42.470 --> 01:18:45.220
<b>You drove with all your might.</b>

01:18:45.350 --> 01:18:46.640
<b>Let me do this much.</b>

01:18:47.310 --> 01:18:49.850
<b>You protected me, Shizuka-san,</b>

01:18:49.980 --> 01:18:51.690
<b>you were kind to me...</b>

01:18:51.810 --> 01:18:55.150
<b>My previous owners never did that to me...</b>

01:18:55.270 --> 01:18:58.110
<b>I'm not your owner! I'm your friend.</b>

01:18:59.030 --> 01:19:01.570
<b>Friend...</b>

01:19:02.780 --> 01:19:04.160
<b>Oh?</b>

01:19:04.490 --> 01:19:05.990
<b>The bolt...</b>

01:19:10.410 --> 01:19:11.410
<b>There!</b>

01:19:12.040 --> 01:19:13.870
<b>What's this...?</b>

01:19:14.210 --> 01:19:18.340
<b>A charm. So that we're always safe when driving.</b>

01:19:29.060 --> 01:19:32.980
<b>It's perfect! Now I can drive anywhere!</b>

01:19:37.520 --> 01:19:40.610
<b>Shizuka-chan?</b>

01:19:40.730 --> 01:19:43.070
<b>Huh? What're the two of you doin'?!</b>

01:19:43.200 --> 01:19:44.570
<b>That's not fair!</b>

01:19:45.110 --> 01:19:46.950
<b>Gian, Suneo, look!</b>

01:19:47.070 --> 01:19:49.540
<b>- What's that?
- Isn't it cool?</b>

01:19:50.160 --> 01:19:51.870
<b>Shizuka-san did it for me.</b>

01:19:52.000 --> 01:19:55.870
<b>This is so that we're always safe while driving!
It's a charm!</b>

01:19:56.000 --> 01:19:58.000
<b>That's great.</b>

01:20:01.050 --> 01:20:03.300
<b>There aren't any Battlefish, huh?</b>

01:20:03.420 --> 01:20:05.930
<b>Yeah, seems like they're doing a good job.</b>

01:20:09.970 --> 01:20:11.890
<b>Is that the barrier?</b>

01:20:15.810 --> 01:20:18.360
<b>We'll be in uncharted territory past this point.</b>

01:20:18.940 --> 01:20:20.860
<b>This is the realm of Atlantis.</b>

01:20:24.070 --> 01:20:27.070
<b>Let's test it out!</b>

01:20:39.920 --> 01:20:42.000
<b>That's insane!</b>

01:20:42.670 --> 01:20:46.970
<b>A frontal assault is impossible.
Miss Triline must've...</b>

01:20:47.090 --> 01:20:50.390
<b>Buggy, is there a chimney cave around here?</b>

01:20:53.180 --> 01:20:54.680
<b>I found one.</b>

01:20:54.810 --> 01:20:56.310
<b>That must be it!</b>

01:21:01.440 --> 01:21:03.230
<b>This is it, no doubt about it.</b>

01:21:03.360 --> 01:21:07.070
<b>The temperatures are in the hundreds of degrees,
and it's filled with toxic gases.</b>

01:21:07.200 --> 01:21:10.240
<b>We couldn't have advanced
without the Adapting Light.</b>

01:21:14.040 --> 01:21:15.790
<b>Buggy, look out!</b>

01:21:28.300 --> 01:21:30.590
<b>The only way is...</b>

01:21:35.060 --> 01:21:38.060
<b>Can't we use Doraemon's
gadgets to move the rocks?</b>

01:21:38.190 --> 01:21:39.230
<b>Gadgets...</b>

01:21:39.350 --> 01:21:41.690
<b>I know!
Chameleon Cap!</b>

01:21:41.810 --> 01:21:43.610
<b>That's a great idea!</b>

01:21:51.030 --> 01:21:52.700
<b>Let's go in!</b>

01:22:02.250 --> 01:22:03.840
<b>We have a report!</b>

01:22:03.960 --> 01:22:06.340
<b>Preparations for firing the Demon Horns confirmed!</b>

01:22:07.340 --> 01:22:09.130
<b>The number is approximately...</b>

01:22:09.260 --> 01:22:11.090
<b>Over 60 missiles!</b>

01:22:15.850 --> 01:22:18.730
<b>We'll be arriving at the barrier soon.</b>

01:22:19.020 --> 01:22:22.560
<b>Hey, what if the barrier extends underground?</b>

01:22:22.690 --> 01:22:25.690
<b>If that happens, we'll all be annihilated.</b>

01:22:26.360 --> 01:22:28.070
<b>I'm sure we'll be fine!</b>

01:22:28.190 --> 01:22:29.450
<b>Shizuka-chan!</b>

01:22:29.950 --> 01:22:31.110
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:22:34.410 --> 01:22:37.490
<b>60 meters to the barrier.</b>

01:22:37.620 --> 01:22:39.000
<b>- Mommy!
- 50...</b>

01:22:39.460 --> 01:22:41.920
<b>40... 30...</b>

01:22:42.460 --> 01:22:44.840
<b>20... 10...</b>

01:22:50.510 --> 01:22:51.720
<b>We've crossed it.</b>

01:22:52.010 --> 01:22:54.300
<b>Yay!</b>

01:23:05.650 --> 01:23:08.480
<b>Ah... hey, look.</b>

01:23:08.900 --> 01:23:11.610
<b>It's like a graveyard fer ships and airplanes.</b>

01:23:11.740 --> 01:23:15.620
<b>I get it! They hit the barrier and crashed!</b>

01:23:15.740 --> 01:23:17.660
<b>The mystery of the Bermuda Triangle...</b>

01:23:17.780 --> 01:23:19.660
<b>is this...?</b>

01:23:19.790 --> 01:23:21.660
<b>Hey, something's coming!</b>

01:23:22.580 --> 01:23:23.620
<b>It's the Iron Cavalry.</b>

01:23:30.300 --> 01:23:32.170
<b>What creepy freaks.</b>

01:23:32.300 --> 01:23:34.680
<b>Gian!</b>

01:23:48.520 --> 01:23:50.110
<b>Ah... sound.</b>

01:23:50.230 --> 01:23:52.740
<b>They react to sound.</b>

01:23:53.320 --> 01:23:55.030
<b>Jet Mole.</b>

01:24:20.760 --> 01:24:22.310
<b>They're going back.</b>

01:24:22.520 --> 01:24:25.390
<b>They think they've defeated us.</b>

01:24:25.690 --> 01:24:27.600
<b>- Please surface.
- Why?</b>

01:24:27.730 --> 01:24:29.020
<b>We'll get caught!</b>

01:24:29.270 --> 01:24:32.990
<b>They must be heading back to the Devil's Castle.</b>

01:24:39.240 --> 01:24:41.870
<b>Alright, let's hurry and chase after them.</b>

01:24:41.990 --> 01:24:43.950
<b>Can we count on you, Buggy?</b>

01:24:43.950 --> 01:24:44.950
<b>Buggy?</b>

01:24:45.250 --> 01:24:48.880
<b>Even if I wanted to go, my
self-defense program is being triggered.</b>

01:24:49.540 --> 01:24:51.800
<b>My tires won't move.</b>

01:24:51.920 --> 01:24:54.760
<b>Come on! We came all this way together!</b>

01:24:54.880 --> 01:24:56.800
<b>Can't we do anything?</b>

01:24:58.010 --> 01:24:59.260
<b>Nothing we can do.</b>

01:25:02.010 --> 01:25:05.640
<b>Without Buggy's speed, we won't
be able to catch up with them.</b>

01:25:05.770 --> 01:25:08.730
<b>Ah! What if we could do the same as Triline-san?</b>

01:25:08.850 --> 01:25:11.610
<b>That's it!
We can get caught on purpose!</b>

01:25:11.730 --> 01:25:14.110
<b>It's dangerous, but worth a shot.</b>

01:25:14.230 --> 01:25:16.110
<b>Alright! I'll do it.</b>

01:25:16.240 --> 01:25:18.450
<b>No, if El gets caught, there's nothing we can do.</b>

01:25:18.570 --> 01:25:19.870
<b>I'll be the one to do it!</b>

01:25:19.990 --> 01:25:23.080
<b>- Gian, are you sure?!
- There must be other ways!</b>

01:25:23.200 --> 01:25:26.370
<b>There's no time, so I'll use sound to attract them!</b>

01:25:26.500 --> 01:25:30.040
<b>Wait a minute! There's no guarantee
it'll work the same way!</b>

01:25:31.500 --> 01:25:33.500
<b>Shizuka-chan?!</b>

01:25:35.760 --> 01:25:38.090
<b>Triline-san was captured alive.</b>

01:25:38.220 --> 01:25:41.640
<b>So for girls, the possibility isn't zero!</b>

01:25:41.760 --> 01:25:44.680
<b>That's true, but...</b>

01:25:44.850 --> 01:25:46.310
<b>This is bad! They've noticed us!</b>

01:25:46.850 --> 01:25:48.020
<b>They're coming back!</b>

01:25:48.520 --> 01:25:50.480
<b>Everyone, this way! Quickly!</b>

01:25:50.600 --> 01:25:52.480
<b>If it gets dangerous, I'll step in.</b>

01:25:52.810 --> 01:25:54.270
<b>You guys, run!</b>

01:25:54.400 --> 01:25:55.730
<b>Shizuka-chan!</b>

01:25:55.860 --> 01:25:59.240
<b>Don't worry, Nobita-san. I'll succeed!</b>

01:25:59.570 --> 01:26:03.160
<b>So please, come and save me later!</b>

01:26:04.450 --> 01:26:06.040
<b>Nobita, hurry.</b>

01:26:36.650 --> 01:26:37.650
<b>It's worked out well.</b>

01:26:40.150 --> 01:26:42.530
<b>- Shizuka-san...
- Shh.</b>

01:26:50.250 --> 01:26:52.750
<b>- After them.
- Yeah!</b>

01:27:03.550 --> 01:27:05.350
<b>So that's the Devil's Castle...</b>

01:27:06.260 --> 01:27:08.770
<b>We're finally here...</b>

01:27:08.890 --> 01:27:11.020
<b>Now, let's end this!</b>

01:27:11.140 --> 01:27:13.650
<b>Everyone, use these!</b>

01:27:15.110 --> 01:27:17.980
<b>I wonder if we really can stop it.</b>

01:27:18.280 --> 01:27:21.400
<b>It'll be fine! If we all work together...</b>

01:27:21.530 --> 01:27:23.450
<b>See, when we all worked together,</b>

01:27:23.660 --> 01:27:26.160
<b>I was able to finish my homework, right?</b>

01:27:26.410 --> 01:27:27.990
<b>Nobita-kun...</b>

01:27:28.120 --> 01:27:29.910
<b>Helping Nobita with homework</b>

01:27:30.040 --> 01:27:32.410
<b>makes saving the world look easy.</b>

01:27:32.540 --> 01:27:35.130
<b>- Right, Suneo?
- I guess so...</b>

01:27:35.290 --> 01:27:37.670
<b>Ah... I didn't say that!</b>

01:27:37.790 --> 01:27:41.090
<b>Was your homework really that difficult?</b>

01:27:41.300 --> 01:27:42.630
<b>Even you, El...?</b>

01:27:45.010 --> 01:27:46.640
<b>Alright, let's go!</b>

01:27:46.890 --> 01:27:50.180
<b>To save Shizuka-chan and stop Poseidon!</b>

01:28:09.790 --> 01:28:11.410
<b>Poseidon...!</b>

01:28:12.580 --> 01:28:15.170
<b>That is not the girl.</b>

01:28:15.420 --> 01:28:17.580
<b>Why did you target her and me?</b>

01:28:17.710 --> 01:28:21.340
<b>We have very little data on females.</b>

01:28:21.460 --> 01:28:24.760
<b>We must be perfect.</b>

01:28:24.880 --> 01:28:27.050
<b>Become our data.</b>

01:28:33.480 --> 01:28:35.890
<b>What is this place?
It's creepy...</b>

01:28:36.020 --> 01:28:38.900
<b>Did we go somewhere we're not supposed to?</b>

01:28:42.230 --> 01:28:44.320
<b>Could it be that these all are...</b>

01:28:44.650 --> 01:28:46.910
<b>The Iron Cavalry.</b>

01:28:57.210 --> 01:28:58.250
<b>Let's go!</b>

01:28:58.380 --> 01:29:00.670
<b>I'll take them all down!</b>

01:29:02.670 --> 01:29:05.380
<b>- Bang!
- Take them down!</b>

01:29:05.510 --> 01:29:06.840
<b>Bang!</b>

01:29:07.090 --> 01:29:08.390
<b>Bang!</b>

01:29:20.650 --> 01:29:22.770
<b>This is bad! We're running out of time!</b>

01:29:24.570 --> 01:29:26.700
<b>The time has come.</b>

01:29:26.990 --> 01:29:30.280
<b>The Earth will become a dead planet.</b>

01:29:30.700 --> 01:29:31.950
<b>You're wrong!</b>

01:29:32.080 --> 01:29:34.790
<b>Leave it to me and Suneo! Go!</b>

01:29:34.910 --> 01:29:36.830
<b>We need to hurry before it erupts!</b>

01:29:36.960 --> 01:29:40.080
<b>Defeat Poseidon and come back with Shizuka-chan!</b>

01:29:40.210 --> 01:29:41.380
<b>We'll all go home together!</b>

01:29:41.500 --> 01:29:43.920
<b>That's the only option, let's go!</b>

01:29:44.050 --> 01:29:46.380
<b>- Nobita-kun!
- Yeah!</b>

01:29:55.390 --> 01:29:58.770
<b>Ah! Don't worry about me, go ahead!</b>

01:30:08.190 --> 01:30:10.490
<b>Your opponent is me!</b>

01:30:18.500 --> 01:30:21.120
<b>Please, make it in time.</b>

01:30:25.000 --> 01:30:28.510
<b>El and the others will definitely win!
We have to hold out till then!</b>

01:30:32.760 --> 01:30:35.140
<b>This is just volcanic activity!</b>

01:30:35.260 --> 01:30:38.100
<b>Atlantis perished thousands of years ago!</b>

01:30:38.430 --> 01:30:42.440
<b>Any threat to Atlantis will be responded
to with the Devil's Horns.</b>

01:30:42.560 --> 01:30:44.860
<b>That is how we have been programmed.</b>

01:30:44.980 --> 01:30:46.570
<b>Shizuka-chan!</b>

01:30:49.280 --> 01:30:51.030
<b>We're here to save you!</b>

01:30:51.450 --> 01:30:52.780
<b>Nobita-san!</b>

01:30:52.910 --> 01:30:54.570
<b>So, you've made it this far?</b>

01:30:54.700 --> 01:30:57.080
<b>Let go of Shizuka-chan!</b>

01:30:57.200 --> 01:30:59.580
<b>Silence, human!</b>

01:31:00.580 --> 01:31:03.500
<b>- Woah!
- Nobita-kun!</b>

01:31:03.630 --> 01:31:05.090
<b>Nobita-san!</b>

01:31:05.420 --> 01:31:07.590
<b>- Ugh...
- Are you alright?!</b>

01:31:07.710 --> 01:31:10.340
<b>Ah, the Bounce-Back Cape?!</b>

01:31:12.300 --> 01:31:13.590
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

01:31:15.260 --> 01:31:18.010
<b>A machine? This is of great interest.</b>

01:31:18.140 --> 01:31:23.020
<b>But difficult to comprehend.
Why are you with the humans?</b>

01:31:23.810 --> 01:31:25.480
<b>He's not a machine!</b>

01:31:25.810 --> 01:31:27.190
<b>He's my friend!</b>

01:31:27.320 --> 01:31:29.190
<b>That's why he's with us!</b>

01:31:30.240 --> 01:31:32.150
<b>F-r-i-e-n-d...</b>

01:31:35.530 --> 01:31:37.370
<b>Poseidon! This is the end!</b>

01:31:53.170 --> 01:31:54.680
<b>Nobita-san!</b>

01:31:55.140 --> 01:31:56.590
<b>Dora-chan!</b>

01:31:57.430 --> 01:31:59.810
<b>Friends are weak.</b>

01:32:01.020 --> 01:32:03.270
<b>Is it over already?</b>

01:32:04.230 --> 01:32:08.770
<b>We all worked together to get this far, but...</b>

01:32:16.280 --> 01:32:18.830
<b>It's all over, isn't it?
Everything...</b>

01:32:28.290 --> 01:32:31.210
<b>Are you crying, Shizuka-san?</b>

01:32:36.680 --> 01:32:37.800
<b>Buggy-chan?!</b>

01:32:37.930 --> 01:32:40.600
<b>Don't cry, Shizuka-san.</b>

01:32:40.760 --> 01:32:41.770
<b>Buggy?</b>

01:32:41.890 --> 01:32:43.980
<b>He's bullying you, right?</b>

01:32:44.100 --> 01:32:46.270
<b>How dare you... 
How dare you?!</b>

01:32:48.440 --> 01:32:50.270
<b>I won't forgive you!</b>

01:32:53.070 --> 01:32:54.240
<b>Buggy-chan!</b>

01:32:54.610 --> 01:32:56.700
<b>Buggy!</b>

01:32:57.950 --> 01:33:00.870
<b><i>Why are humans so irrational?</i></b>

01:33:00.990 --> 01:33:02.870
<b><i>Back then...</i></b>

01:33:02.990 --> 01:33:06.920
<b><i>Even though I knew better, I
didn't make the 'correct' choice.</i></b>

01:33:07.120 --> 01:33:09.420
<b><i>If you think it's right...</i></b>

01:33:09.540 --> 01:33:12.550
<b><i>Is there a difference between 'right' and 'correct'?</i></b>

01:33:12.670 --> 01:33:15.340
<b><i>There are times when there isn't.</i></b>

01:33:15.470 --> 01:33:18.090
<b><i>What your heart thinks is right...</i></b>

01:33:18.220 --> 01:33:21.510
<b><i>Isn't 'heart' your internal organ...?</i></b>

01:33:21.640 --> 01:33:23.430
<b><i>No... it's different.</i></b>

01:33:23.680 --> 01:33:26.560
<b><i>I don't understand what a 'heart' is.</i></b>

01:33:26.680 --> 01:33:29.060
<b><i>'Right' and 'correct' aren't the same thing...</i></b>

01:33:29.810 --> 01:33:31.480
<b><i>It's like...</i></b>

01:33:31.610 --> 01:33:33.480
<b><i>a 'bug', isn't it?</i></b>

01:33:51.960 --> 01:33:54.420
<b>Hm...? They stopped.</b>

01:33:54.550 --> 01:33:56.460
<b>Nobita and the others did it!</b>

01:34:01.390 --> 01:34:02.890
<b>It's a miracle.</b>

01:34:05.390 --> 01:34:08.310
<b>Whoo! Ya did it, El!</b>

01:34:17.190 --> 01:34:19.030
<b>Shizuka-chan.</b>

01:34:23.660 --> 01:34:25.870
<b>Hey, this...</b>

01:34:40.090 --> 01:34:41.590
<b>We need to get out of here!</b>

01:34:41.720 --> 01:34:44.100
<b>Hey! This way!</b>

01:34:45.470 --> 01:34:46.760
<b>Hurry!</b>

01:34:56.270 --> 01:34:58.780
<b>So, it's over now, right?</b>

01:34:58.900 --> 01:35:01.280
<b>Where's Buggy? Come on out.</b>

01:35:01.400 --> 01:35:02.860
<b>Let's all go home.</b>

01:35:05.120 --> 01:35:07.580
<b>Why're ya all so quiet?</b>

01:35:07.700 --> 01:35:09.250
<b>What's going on?</b>

01:35:10.210 --> 01:35:12.460
<b>Say something...</b>

01:35:17.130 --> 01:35:21.470
<b>Poseidon has disappeared, and all
the Devil's Horns were also destroyed.</b>

01:35:21.590 --> 01:35:23.510
<b>The world has been saved!</b>

01:35:25.760 --> 01:35:29.220
<b>Everyone, the reason we were
able to defeat Poseidon is...</b>

01:35:29.890 --> 01:35:32.560
<b>because of these Surface Dwellers here, and Buggy.</b>

01:35:32.690 --> 01:35:35.650
<b>This was only possible because of these six friends.</b>

01:35:35.770 --> 01:35:39.940
<b>And I've learned something important from them.</b>

01:35:40.070 --> 01:35:41.820
<b>That is the 'heart'.</b>

01:35:41.950 --> 01:35:45.740
<b>A feeling of consideration for others,
the kindness to protect one's friends.</b>

01:35:46.120 --> 01:35:49.240
<b>The warmth of not abandoning someone in need.</b>

01:35:49.490 --> 01:35:53.250
<b>And that heart exists within us as well.</b>

01:35:53.370 --> 01:35:55.880
<b>The curse of Atlantis is gone!</b>

01:35:56.000 --> 01:35:58.340
<b>This is a victory for our hearts!</b>

01:35:58.460 --> 01:36:02.630
<b>And this heart is precisely the
power that will shape the future!</b>

01:36:02.760 --> 01:36:04.680
<b>Let's move forward together!</b>

01:36:04.800 --> 01:36:07.470
<b>Towards a world connected by hearts!</b>

01:36:08.510 --> 01:36:11.430
<b>I wish Buggy could've heard this too.</b>

01:36:12.140 --> 01:36:13.890
<b>Nobita-kun...</b>

01:36:15.020 --> 01:36:16.520
<b>Nobita-san.</b>

01:36:18.190 --> 01:36:21.360
<b>I'm sure Buggy-chan understands it too.</b>

01:36:23.240 --> 01:36:24.820
<b>You're right.</b>

01:36:39.090 --> 01:36:40.710
<b>Someday!</b>

01:36:41.000 --> 01:36:43.340
<b>I hope that Surface Dwellers and Undersea Dwellers</b>

01:36:43.460 --> 01:36:46.180
<b>can join hands and co-exist someday!</b>

01:36:46.470 --> 01:36:49.140
<b>- See ya!
- Goodbye!</b>

01:36:50.810 --> 01:36:53.100
<b>I'm sure that day will come!</b>

01:37:00.980 --> 01:37:02.780
<b>Come on, let's go home.</b>

01:37:04.570 --> 01:37:06.070
<b>Nobita-kun!</b>

01:37:06.240 --> 01:37:07.320
<b>Yeah!</b>

